IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `dg-core`
IMPORT `dg3-stock-issue`
IMPORT `dg3-capital-dividends`
IMPORT `dg3-own-stock`
IMPORT `dg3-subscriptions`
IMPORT `dg3-certificates`
IMPORT `dg3-transfers`
IMPORT `dg3-s203`

-- Delaware General Corporation Law, 8 Del. C. ch. 1: Subchapter V (stock and dividends), sections 151 to 174, and sections 201 to 203 of Subchapter VI -- THE SEAT LAYER.
--
-- SEAT: a person who incorporates, directs or holds stock in a Delaware corporation under the General Corporation Law: an incorporator, a director or officer,
-- or a stockholder, including a minority stockholder. They ask what the Law lets them do, what it requires of them, what they may require of the corporation, and what can be done to them.
-- Nobody else gets a seat: the Court of Chancery, the Secretary of State and the Attorney General appear only as what their acts mean for this person
-- (what they may apply for, what must be served, what they must give, what may be done to them).
--
-- PLAIN INPUTS. Every question takes plain inputs -- yes/no, a number, a date, or a choice from the Law's own list -- one for each fact the person can state,
-- each with a @desc worded as the person would be asked. The records that the layer-1 modules expect are built inside each question, in its WHERE, from those answers,
-- and the SAME layer-1 rule is then called; no rule is restated here. A record field that the rule called never reads is given a fixed placeholder, with a comment saying so.
-- Nothing here is new law.
--
-- WHAT THE PERSON CANNOT STATE. Three kinds of input are the outcome of a section outside this piece, or of someone else's judgment, and are asked as facts:
--   * "has the certificate been executed, acknowledged, filed and become effective under section 103?" (dg1);
--   * a court's satisfaction, a board's judgment, "good faith", "a reasonable time", "as soon as practicable" (the Law hands them to someone else; the question asks whether that holds);
--   * the Law's references to other statutes (Article 8 of Title 6, the Investment Company Act, the Internal Revenue Code).
--
-- Amounts are in United States dollars. A percentage is entered as a number between 0 and 100. A vote is counted in votes, not shares (section 203(c)(8); dg-core's note on section 212(a)).
-- A question about stock "like mine" speaks for the class or series; a question about "our corporation" speaks for the corporation of which the person is a director or officer.
-- The stockholder-to-member reading of section 114(a) is not applied: sections 151 to 158, 161 to 168 and 203 are taken out of it by section 114(b)(2), and section 114(c)(3) takes subchapters V and VI out of it for a nonprofit nonstock corporation.


§ `Section 151: classes and series of stock; redemption; rights`

-- Section 151(a). The terms (voting powers, designations, preferences, rights) of a class or series are fixed in the certificate of incorporation, or in a board resolution adopted
-- under authority the certificate expressly gives the board; a term may depend on facts outside that instrument if the instrument clearly says how the facts operate.
@export May the terms of a class or series of our stock be fixed this way (s 151(a))?
GIVEN `where the terms of the class or series are stated` IS A `Where a provision is made` @desc Where are the terms of the class or series (its voting powers, designations, preferences and rights) stated? One of: in the certificate of incorporation (or an amendment); in a resolution of the board of directors; in the bylaws; in none of these.
      `the certificate gives the board authority to fix them` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the certificate of incorporation expressly give the board of directors authority to fix the terms by resolution?
      `a term depends on facts outside the certificate or resolution` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does any term depend on facts ascertainable outside the certificate or the resolution (for example, the occurrence of an event)?
      `the instrument says how those facts operate` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the certificate or resolution clearly and expressly set out the manner in which those facts operate on the term?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May the terms of the class or series be fixed this way` IF
    `s 151(a) the terms of the class or series are authorised` `our terms`
    WHERE
        `our terms` MEANS `s 151(a) Terms of a class or series` WITH
            `where the terms are stated` IS `where the terms of the class or series are stated`
            `authority to fix the terms is expressly vested in the board by the certificate` IS `the certificate gives the board authority to fix them`
            `a term depends on facts ascertainable outside the instrument that states it` IS `a term depends on facts outside the certificate or resolution`
            `the instrument clearly and expressly sets forth how those facts operate on the term` IS `the instrument says how those facts operate`

-- Section 151(a), "facts". The term includes the occurrence of any event, including a determination or action by any person or body, including the corporation.
@export Is the occurrence of an event, or someone's determination or action, a "fact" for the terms of a class or series (s 151(a))?
GIVEN `the matter is an event, or a determination or action by a person or body` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the matter the occurrence of an event, including a determination or action by any person or body (the corporation included)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is the matter a fact for the terms of a class or series` IS
    `s 151(a) the matter is a fact for the purposes of that subsection` `the matter is an event, or a determination or action by a person or body`

@export Does the power to adjust the capital stock apply to my class or series (s 151(a))?
GIVEN `my stock is of a class or series that the corporation may issue under section 151(a)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is my stock of a class or series that the corporation may issue under section 151(a)?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Does the power to adjust the capital stock apply to my class or series` IF
    `s 151(a) the power to adjust the capital stock applies to the class or series` `my stock is of a class or series that the corporation may issue under section 151(a)`

-- Section 151(b). Redemption.
@export May stock like mine be made subject to redemption (s 151(b))?
GIVEN `how the redemption is triggered` IS A `s 151(b) How a redemption is triggered` @desc How is the redemption triggered? One of: at the option of the corporation under s 151(b); at the option of the holders of the stock under s 151(b); upon the happening of a specified event under s 151(b).
      `full voting shares will remain outstanding` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Immediately after the redemption, will 1 or more shares of 1 or more classes or series with full voting powers be outstanding?
      `the stock is stock of a registered investment company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the stock stock of a regulated investment company registered under the Investment Company Act of 1940?
      `the corporation's licence, franchise or exchange membership is conditioned on its holders' qualifications` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the corporation hold (directly or indirectly) a licence or franchise from a governmental agency to conduct its business, or is it a member of a national securities exchange, conditioned on some or all holders of its stock having prescribed qualifications?
      `the redemption is only to the extent necessary to keep or reinstate that licence, franchise or membership` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the redemption only to the extent necessary to prevent the loss of the licence, franchise or membership, or to reinstate it?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May stock like mine be made subject to redemption` IF
    `s 151(b) the stock may be made subject to redemption` `our redemption terms`
    WHERE
        `our redemption terms` MEANS `s 151(b) Redemption terms` WITH
            `how the redemption is triggered` IS `how the redemption is triggered`
            `immediately following the redemption 1 or more shares of 1 or more classes or series with full voting powers will be outstanding` IS `full voting shares will remain outstanding`
            `the stock is stock of a regulated investment company registered under the Investment Company Act of 1940` IS `the stock is stock of a registered investment company`
            `the corporation holds a licence or franchise from a governmental agency to conduct its business, or is a member of a national securities exchange, conditioned on holders of its stock possessing prescribed qualifications` IS `the corporation's licence, franchise or exchange membership is conditioned on its holders' qualifications`
            `the redemption is to the extent necessary to prevent the loss of the licence, franchise or membership or to reinstate it` IS `the redemption is only to the extent necessary to keep or reinstate that licence, franchise or membership`

@export Are the redemption price and times of my stock validly stated (s 151(b))?
GIVEN `where the redemption terms are stated` IS A `Where a provision is made` @desc Where are the times, price or rate and adjustments for redemption stated? One of: in the certificate of incorporation; in a resolution of the board of directors; in the bylaws; in none of these.
      `the certificate gives the board authority to fix them` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the certificate of incorporation expressly give the board of directors authority to fix the redemption terms by resolution?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Are the redemption price and times of my stock validly stated` IF
    `s 151(b) the redemption price and times are stated where that subsection requires` `where the redemption terms are stated` `the certificate gives the board authority to fix them`

-- Section 151(c) to (e). Preferences, rights on dissolution, conversion.
@export Am I entitled to dividends on my preferred or special stock at the rate and on the terms stated (s 151(c))?
GIVEN `my stock is preferred or special stock` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is my stock preferred or special stock of a class or series?
      `where the dividend terms are stated` IS A `Where a provision is made` @desc Where are the dividend rate, conditions, times, preference and cumulative or noncumulative character stated? One of: in the certificate of incorporation; in a resolution of the board of directors; in the bylaws; in none of these.
      `the certificate gives the board authority to fix them` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the certificate of incorporation expressly give the board of directors authority to fix them by resolution?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Am I entitled to dividends on my preferred or special stock as stated` IF
    `s 151(c) the holder of the preferred or special stock is entitled to dividends as stated` `my stock is preferred or special stock` `where the dividend terms are stated` `the certificate gives the board authority to fix them`

@export May a dividend now be paid on the stock that ranks behind the preferred and special stocks (s 151(c))?
GIVEN `the preferred and special stocks have been paid or set apart` IS A BOOLEAN @desc To the extent of their preference, have dividends on the preferred and special stocks been paid, or declared and set apart for payment?
      `assets are available for dividends` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the remaining assets of the corporation available for dividends as the rest of the chapter provides?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May a dividend now be paid on the remaining classes or series` IF
    `s 151(c) a dividend on the remaining classes or series may then be paid` `the preferred and special stocks have been paid or set apart` `assets are available for dividends`

@export Am I entitled to the stated rights on dissolution or a distribution of assets (s 151(d))?
GIVEN `my stock is preferred or special stock` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is my stock preferred or special stock of a class or series?
      `where the rights on dissolution are stated` IS A `Where a provision is made` @desc Where are my rights on dissolution or on a distribution of assets stated? One of: in the certificate of incorporation; in a resolution of the board of directors; in the bylaws; in none of these.
      `the certificate gives the board authority to fix them` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the certificate of incorporation expressly give the board of directors authority to fix them by resolution?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Am I entitled to the stated rights on dissolution or distribution of assets` IF
    `s 151(d) the holder of the preferred or special stock is entitled to the stated rights on dissolution or distribution of assets` `my stock is preferred or special stock` `where the rights on dissolution are stated` `the certificate gives the board authority to fix them`

@export May stock like mine be made convertible into, or exchangeable for, other stock (s 151(e))?
GIVEN `the shares to be received are of another class or series of the corporation's stock` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the shares to be received shares of another class or series of the corporation's own stock?
      `where the conversion or exchange terms are stated` IS A `Where a provision is made` @desc Where are the price or rate of conversion or exchange and its adjustments stated? One of: in the certificate of incorporation; in a resolution of the board of directors; in the bylaws; in none of these.
      `the certificate gives the board authority to fix them` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the certificate of incorporation expressly give the board of directors authority to fix them by resolution?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May stock like mine be made convertible or exchangeable` IF
    `s 151(e) the stock may be made convertible or exchangeable` `the shares to be received are of another class or series of the corporation's stock` `where the conversion or exchange terms are stated` `the certificate gives the board authority to fix them`

-- Section 151(f). What a certificate says about class rights; the notice for uncertificated stock.
@export Does my certificate state the rights of each class and series as the Law requires (s 151(f))?
GIVEN `the corporation may issue more than 1 class of stock or more than 1 series of a class` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the corporation authorised to issue more than 1 class of stock, or more than 1 series of any class?
      `the certificate sets the rights out in full or summarises them` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the face or back of the certificate set out in full, or summarise, the powers, designations, preferences and rights of each class or series and the qualifications, limitations and restrictions?
      `the certificate says the corporation will furnish the rights without charge on request` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Instead, does the certificate state that the corporation will furnish them without charge to each stockholder who asks?
      `section 202 provides otherwise for the matter` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does section 202 (restrictions on transfer and ownership) provide otherwise for the matter?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Does my certificate state the rights of each class and series as the Law requires` IF
    `s 151(f) the certificate states the rights as that subsection requires` `my certificate`
    WHERE
        `my certificate` MEANS `s 151(f) What a certificate says about class rights` WITH
            `the corporation is authorised to issue more than 1 class of stock or more than 1 series of any class` IS `the corporation may issue more than 1 class of stock or more than 1 series of a class`
            `the certificate sets the rights out in full or summarises them` IS `the certificate sets the rights out in full or summarises them`
            `the certificate states that the corporation will furnish them without charge to each stockholder who so requests` IS `the certificate says the corporation will furnish the rights without charge on request`
            `section 202 provides otherwise for the matter` IS `section 202 provides otherwise for the matter`

@export Was the notice I received for my uncertificated stock what the Law requires (s 151(f))?
GIVEN `my notice was in writing or by electronic transmission` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the notice given to you in writing or by electronic transmission?
      `my notice came within a reasonable time` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did it come within a reasonable time after the issuance or transfer of the uncertificated stock to you?
      `my notice has the information certificates must carry` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it contain the information that certificates must carry under section 156, 202(a), 218(a) or 364?
      `my notice has the class rights or a statement that they will be furnished` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it contain the information required by section 151, or a statement that the corporation will furnish it without charge to each stockholder who asks?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Was the notice I received for my uncertificated stock what the Law requires` IF
    `s 151(f) the notice to the registered owner of uncertificated stock is as that subsection requires` `my notice`
    WHERE
        `my notice` MEANS `s 151(f) The notice to the registered owner of uncertificated stock` WITH
            `the notice was given in writing or by electronic transmission` IS `my notice was in writing or by electronic transmission`
            `the notice was given within a reasonable time after the issuance or transfer` IS `my notice came within a reasonable time`
            `the notice contains the information required to be set forth or stated on certificates by section 156, 202(a), 218(a) or 364` IS `my notice has the information certificates must carry`
            `the notice contains the information required by section 151 or a statement that the corporation will furnish it without charge to each stockholder who so requests` IS `my notice has the class rights or a statement that they will be furnished`

@export Do I have the same rights and obligations as a holder of a certificate of the same class and series (s 151(f))?
GIVEN `the law expressly provides otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does a law expressly provide that holders of uncertificated stock and holders of certificates of the same class and series have different rights or obligations?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Do I have the same rights and obligations as a holder of a certificate of the same class and series` IF
    `s 151(f) the holders of uncertificated stock and of certificates of the same class and series have identical rights and obligations` `the law expressly provides otherwise`

-- Section 151(g). Certificates of designations.
@export Must our corporation file a certificate of designations before it issues shares of this class or series (s 151(g))?
GIVEN `the terms are in a board resolution under authority the certificate expressly gives` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the terms of the class or series provided for in a resolution of the board adopted under authority expressly vested in it by the certificate of incorporation?
      `the terms are set forth in the certificate or an amendment` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the terms set forth in the certificate of incorporation or an amendment to it?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Must our corporation file a certificate of designations before issuing shares of this class or series` IF
    `s 151(g) a certificate of designations is required` `the terms are in a board resolution under authority the certificate expressly gives` `the terms are set forth in the certificate or an amendment`

@export Has our corporation met the requirement of a certificate of designations (s 151(g))?
GIVEN `the terms are in a board resolution under authority the certificate expressly gives` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the terms of the class or series provided for in a resolution of the board adopted under authority expressly vested in it by the certificate of incorporation?
      `the terms are set forth in the certificate or an amendment` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the terms set forth in the certificate of incorporation or an amendment to it?
      `the certificate of designations is filed and effective` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the certificate of designations been executed, acknowledged and filed, and has it become effective in accordance with section 103?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Has our corporation met the requirement of a certificate of designations` IF
    `s 151(g) the requirement of a certificate of designations is met` (`s 151(g) a certificate of designations is required` `the terms are in a board resolution under authority the certificate expressly gives` `the terms are set forth in the certificate or an amendment`) `the certificate of designations is filed and effective`

@export May the number of shares of our series be increased or decreased by certificate (s 151(g))?
GIVEN `our resolution otherwise provides` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the board resolution that established the series provide otherwise than the Law's default on increasing or decreasing the number of shares?
      `the number of shares of the series now` IS A NUMBER @desc How many shares does the series now have?
      `the number of shares of the series after the change` IS A NUMBER @desc How many shares will it have after the change?
      `the total number of authorised shares of the class` IS A NUMBER @desc How many shares of the class are authorised in all?
      `the number of shares of the series outstanding` IS A NUMBER @desc How many shares of the series are outstanding?
      `a certificate stating that the change was authorised by a board resolution is filed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has a certificate stating that the increase or decrease was authorised by a resolution of the board been executed, acknowledged and filed?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May the number of shares of our series be changed by certificate` IS
    `s 151(g) the number of shares of the series may be changed` `our resolution otherwise provides` `the number of shares of the series now` `the number of shares of the series after the change` `the total number of authorised shares of the class` `the number of shares of the series outstanding` `a certificate stating that the change was authorised by a board resolution is filed`

@export How many shares resume the status they had before the first resolution when our series is decreased (s 151(g))?
GIVEN `the number of shares of the series now` IS A NUMBER @desc How many shares does the series now have?
      `the number of shares of the series after the decrease` IS A NUMBER @desc How many shares will it have after the decrease?
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `How many shares resume their earlier status when our series is decreased` IS
    `s 151(g) the number of shares that resume the status they had before the first resolution` `the number of shares of the series now` `the number of shares of the series after the decrease`

@export Does our certificate eliminate the matters set forth in the certificate of designations for a class or series with no shares outstanding (s 151(g))?
GIVEN `no shares of the class or series are outstanding` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are no shares of the class or series outstanding, either because none were issued or because none remain outstanding?
      `the board resolved that none are outstanding and none will be issued` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the board adopt a resolution that none of the authorised shares of the class or series are outstanding and that none will be issued subject to the certificate of designations previously filed?
      `the elimination certificate is filed and effective` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the certificate setting forth that resolution been executed, acknowledged and filed, and has it become effective in accordance with section 103?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Does our certificate eliminate the matters set forth in the certificate of designations` IF
    `s 151(g) the certificate eliminates from the certificate of incorporation the matters in the certificate of designations` `no shares of the class or series are outstanding` `the board resolved that none are outstanding and none will be issued` `the elimination certificate is filed and effective`

@export May our board amend the terms of a class or series by resolution before any share is issued (s 151(g))?
GIVEN `no shares of the class or series have been issued` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have no shares of stock been issued of the class or series?
      `the class or series was established by a board resolution` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the class or series established by a resolution of the board of directors?
      `our certificate provides otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the certificate of incorporation provide otherwise?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May our board amend the terms of a class or series by resolution before any share is issued` IF
    `s 151(g) the board may amend the terms of the class or series by resolution` `no shares of the class or series have been issued` `the class or series was established by a board resolution` `our certificate provides otherwise`

@export Does our certificate of amendment have the contents the Law requires (s 151(g))?
GIVEN `it states that no shares have been issued` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the certificate state that no shares of the class or series have been issued?
      `it sets forth a copy of the resolution` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it set forth a copy of the resolution or resolutions?
      `the designation is being changed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the designation of the class or series being changed?
      `it indicates the original and the new designation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it indicate the original designation and the new designation?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Does our certificate of amendment have the contents the Law requires` IF
    `s 151(g) the certificate has the contents that paragraphs (1) to (3) require` `our contents`
    WHERE
        `our contents` MEANS `s 151(g) The contents of a certificate amending the terms` WITH
            `it states that no shares of the class or series have been issued` IS `it states that no shares have been issued`
            `it sets forth a copy of the resolution or resolutions` IS `it sets forth a copy of the resolution`
            `the designation of the class or series is being changed` IS `the designation is being changed`
            `it indicates the original designation and the new designation` IS `it indicates the original and the new designation`

@export Does our certificate of amendment amend the certificate of incorporation (s 151(g))?
GIVEN `the certificate has the required contents` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the certificate have the contents that paragraphs (1) to (3) of section 151(g) require?
      `the certificate is filed and effective` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the certificate been executed, acknowledged and filed, and has it become effective in accordance with section 103?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Does our certificate of amendment amend the certificate of incorporation` IF
    `s 151(g) the certificate amends the certificate of incorporation` `the certificate has the required contents` `the certificate is filed and effective`

@export May our board still adopt such resolutions after a certificate or a restated certificate has been filed (s 151(g))?
GIVEN `our board has authority to adopt such resolutions under section 151(g)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the board have authority under section 151(g) to adopt such resolutions?
      `a certificate under section 151(g) has been filed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has a certificate under section 151(g) been filed?
      `a restated certificate has been filed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has a restated certificate of incorporation been filed under section 245?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May our board still adopt such resolutions after a certificate or a restated certificate has been filed` IF
    `s 151(g) the board may subsequently adopt such resolutions` `our board has authority to adopt such resolutions under section 151(g)` `a certificate under section 151(g) has been filed` `a restated certificate has been filed`


§ `Section 152: issuance of stock; lawful consideration; fully paid stock`

-- Section 152(a). The board decides the form and manner of payment; it may authorise issue for cash, tangible or intangible property or any benefit to the corporation, or a combination.
@export Has our board authorised the issue of stock for this consideration (s 152(a))?
GIVEN `the consideration is cash` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the consideration for the stock consist (in whole or part) of cash?
      `the consideration is tangible property` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it consist (in whole or part) of tangible property?
      `the consideration is intangible property` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it consist (in whole or part) of intangible property?
      `the consideration is a benefit to the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it consist (in whole or part) of a benefit to the corporation?
      `a board resolution sets out the numbers, times and consideration` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does a resolution of the board of directors set out the numbers, the times and the consideration for the issue?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Has our board authorised the issue of stock for this consideration` IF
    `s 152(a) the board has authorised the issue of stock for the consideration` `our consideration`
    WHERE
        `our consideration` MEANS `s 152(a) The consideration for an issue of stock` WITH
            `it consists of cash` IS `the consideration is cash`
            `it consists of tangible property` IS `the consideration is tangible property`
            `it consists of intangible property` IS `the consideration is intangible property`
            `it consists of a benefit to the corporation` IS `the consideration is a benefit to the corporation`
            `the numbers, times and consideration are set forth in a resolution of the board of directors` IS `a board resolution sets out the numbers, times and consideration`

-- Section 152(b). A board resolution may delegate the authority to issue stock to a person or body, if it fixes a maximum number of shares, a time period and a minimum consideration,
-- and does not permit the delegate to issue stock to itself.
@export May our board delegate the issue of stock to a person or body (s 152(b))?
GIVEN `the resolution fixes a maximum number of shares` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the resolution fix a maximum number of shares that may be issued under it?
      `the resolution fixes a time period` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the resolution fix a time period during which the shares may be issued?
      `the resolution fixes a minimum consideration` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the resolution fix the minimum consideration for which the shares may be issued?
      `the resolution lets the delegate issue stock to itself` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the resolution permit the person or body to issue stock to itself?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May our board delegate the issue of stock to a person or body` IF
    `s 152(b) the resolution validly delegates the authority to issue stock` `the resolution fixes a maximum number of shares` `the resolution fixes a time period` `the resolution fixes a minimum consideration` `the resolution lets the delegate issue stock to itself`

-- The text does not say whether the minimum consideration is per share or for the whole issue; the person gives the figures in the resolution's own unit.
@export Is this issue within the resolution that delegated the authority to issue stock (s 152(b))?
GIVEN `the maximum number of shares the resolution allows` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the maximum number of shares that may be issued under the resolution?
      `the first day of the time period` IS A DATE @desc What is the first day of the time period the resolution fixes (YYYY-MM-DD)?
      `the last day of the time period` IS A DATE @desc What is the last day of the time period the resolution fixes (YYYY-MM-DD)?
      `the minimum consideration the resolution fixes` IS A NUMBER @desc What minimum consideration does the resolution fix, in dollars, in the same unit as the consideration below (per share, or for the issue as a whole)?
      `the number of shares already issued under the resolution` IS A NUMBER @desc How many shares have already been issued under the resolution?
      `the number of shares in this issue` IS A NUMBER @desc How many shares are in this issue?
      `the day of this issue` IS A DATE @desc On what day is this issue made (YYYY-MM-DD)?
      `the consideration for this issue` IS A NUMBER @desc What consideration is received for this issue, in dollars, in the same unit as the minimum above?
      `the stock is issued to the delegate itself` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the stock issued to the person or body that is issuing it?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is this issue within the resolution that delegated the authority to issue stock` IF
    `s 152(b) the issue is within the delegating resolution` `our resolution` `this issue`
    WHERE
        `our resolution` MEANS `s 152(b) A delegating resolution` WITH
            `the maximum number of shares that may be issued` IS `the maximum number of shares the resolution allows`
            `the first day of the time period` IS `the first day of the time period`
            `the last day of the time period` IS `the last day of the time period`
            `the minimum consideration` IS `the minimum consideration the resolution fixes`
        `this issue` MEANS `s 152(b) One issue under a delegating resolution` WITH
            `the number of shares already issued under the resolution` IS `the number of shares already issued under the resolution`
            `the number of shares in this issue` IS `the number of shares in this issue`
            `the day of this issue` IS `the day of this issue`
            `the consideration for this issue` IS `the consideration for this issue`
            `the stock is issued to the person or body that issues it` IS `the stock is issued to the delegate itself`

-- Section 152(c). Facts outside the resolution; the delegate's own determination.
@export May a provision of our board's resolution depend on facts outside the resolution (s 152(c))?
GIVEN `the resolution is one the board adopts to issue stock or to delegate the issue` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the resolution one contemplated by section 152(a) or (b) (a resolution authorising an issue of stock or delegating it)?
      `a provision depends on facts outside the resolution` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does a provision of the resolution depend on facts ascertainable outside it?
      `the resolution says how those facts operate` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the resolution clearly and expressly set forth the manner in which those facts operate on it?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May a provision of our board's resolution depend on facts outside the resolution` IF
    `s 152(c) the provision may be made dependent on facts ascertainable outside the resolution` `the resolution is one the board adopts to issue stock or to delegate the issue` `a provision depends on facts outside the resolution` `the resolution says how those facts operate`

@export Is the occurrence of an event, or someone's determination or action, a "fact" for a resolution under section 152 (s 152(c))?
GIVEN `the matter is an event, or a determination or action by a person or body` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the matter the occurrence of an event, including a determination or action by any person or body (the corporation included)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is the matter a fact for a resolution under section 152` IS
    `s 152(c) the matter is a fact for the purposes of that section` `the matter is an event, or a determination or action by a person or body`

@export May the limits we fixed for the delegate depend on the delegate's own determination or action (s 152(c))?
GIVEN `the resolution delegates the authority to issue stock` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the resolution delegate to a person or body the authority to issue stock under section 152(b)?
      `a limit depends on the delegate's own determination or action` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the provision on the maximum number, the time period or the minimum consideration made dependent on a determination or action by that person or body?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May the limits fixed for the delegate depend on the delegate's own determination or action` IF
    `s 152(c) the limits fixed under subsection (b) may be made dependent on the delegate` `the resolution delegates the authority to issue stock` `a limit depends on the delegate's own determination or action`

-- Section 152(d).
@export Is the directors' judgment of the value of the consideration conclusive (s 152(d))?
GIVEN `there was actual fraud in the transaction` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was there actual fraud in the transaction?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is the directors' judgment of the value of the consideration conclusive` IF
    `s 152(d) the judgment of the directors as to the value of the consideration is conclusive` `there was actual fraud in the transaction`

@export Is my stock fully paid and nonassessable (s 152(d))?
GIVEN `my stock was issued in accordance with section 152` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was my stock issued in accordance with section 152?
      `the corporation has received the consideration` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the corporation received the consideration for it?
      `my shares were issued as partly paid shares under section 156` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the board issue my shares as partly paid shares under section 156?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is my stock fully paid and nonassessable` IF
    `s 152(d) the stock is deemed fully paid and nonassessable` `my stock was issued in accordance with section 152` `the corporation has received the consideration` `my shares were issued as partly paid shares under section 156`

-- Section 152(e), with section 153: the minimum consideration may not be less than what section 153 requires (for shares with par value, their aggregate par value; nothing for shares without).
@export Is the minimum consideration our board fixed at least what section 153 requires (s 152(e))?
GIVEN `the minimum consideration our board fixed for the shares` IS A NUMBER @desc What minimum consideration did the board fix for the shares, in dollars, for the issue as a whole?
      `the shares have a par value` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do the shares have a par value?
      `the par value of each share` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the par value of each share, in dollars (0 if the shares have none)?
      `the number of shares` IS A NUMBER @desc How many shares are in the issue?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is the minimum consideration our board fixed at least what section 153 requires` IF
    `s 152(e) the minimum consideration is not less than that section 153 requires` `the minimum consideration our board fixed for the shares` (`s 153 the consideration required for the shares, if any` `the shares have a par value` `the par value of each share` `the number of shares`)

§ `Section 153: consideration for stock`

@export What consideration does section 153 require for these shares (s 153(a), (b))?
GIVEN `the shares have a par value` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do the shares have a par value?
      `the par value of each share` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the par value of each share, in dollars (0 if the shares have none)?
      `the number of shares` IS A NUMBER @desc How many shares are in the issue?
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `What consideration does section 153 require for these shares` IS
    `s 153 the consideration required for the shares, if any` `the shares have a par value` `the par value of each share` `the number of shares`

@export May shares with a par value be issued for this consideration (s 153(a))?
GIVEN `the value of the consideration` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the value of the consideration, in dollars?
      `the aggregate par value of the shares` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the aggregate par value of the shares issued, in dollars?
      `who determined the consideration` IS A `s 153 Who determines the consideration` @desc Who determined the consideration? One of: the board of directors under s 152; the stockholders under s 153.
      `our certificate says the stockholders determine it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the certificate of incorporation provide that the stockholders determine the consideration?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May shares with a par value be issued for this consideration` IF
    `s 153(a) the shares with par value may be issued for the consideration` `the value of the consideration` `the aggregate par value of the shares` `who determined the consideration` `our certificate says the stockholders determine it`

@export May shares without par value be issued for this consideration (s 153(b))?
GIVEN `who determined the consideration` IS A `s 153 Who determines the consideration` @desc Who determined the consideration? One of: the board of directors under s 152; the stockholders under s 153.
      `our certificate says the stockholders determine it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the certificate of incorporation provide that the stockholders determine the consideration?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May shares without par value be issued for this consideration` IF
    `s 153(b) the shares without par value may be issued for the consideration` `who determined the consideration` `our certificate says the stockholders determine it`

@export May treasury shares be disposed of in this way (s 153(c))?
GIVEN `they are disposed of in the same manner that shares are issued` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the treasury shares disposed of in the same manner that shares are issued under section 152(a) to (d)?
      `the stockholders determined the consideration` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the stockholders determine the consideration?
      `our certificate says the stockholders determine it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the certificate of incorporation provide that the stockholders determine the consideration?
      `the consideration is cash, property or a benefit` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the consideration consist of cash, tangible or intangible property or any benefit to the corporation, or a combination?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May treasury shares be disposed of in this way` IF
    `s 153(c) the treasury shares may be disposed of in that manner` `they are disposed of in the same manner that shares are issued` `the stockholders determined the consideration` `our certificate says the stockholders determine it` `the consideration is cash, property or a benefit`

-- Section 153(d). A majority of the outstanding stock entitled to vote, or any greater vote the certificate requires. A greater vote is entered as the percentage of the outstanding stock it requires ("at least").
@export Have the stockholders validly determined the consideration for the shares (s 153(d))?
GIVEN `our certificate requires a greater vote` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the certificate of incorporation require a greater vote than a majority of the outstanding stock entitled to vote?
      `the percentage the certificate requires` IS A NUMBER @desc If so, what percentage of the outstanding stock entitled to vote must vote in favor (a number from 0 to 100; 0 if there is no greater vote)?
      `the votes in favor` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes were cast in favor?
      `the outstanding stock entitled to vote, in votes` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes does the outstanding stock entitled to vote carry in all?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Have the stockholders validly determined the consideration for the shares` IS
    `s 153(d) the stockholders' determination of the consideration is adopted` `the greater vote` `the votes in favor` `the outstanding stock entitled to vote, in votes`
    WHERE
        `the greater vote` MEANS
            IF `our certificate requires a greater vote`
            THEN JUST (`at least` ((`the percentage the certificate requires`) DIVIDED BY 100) `of` `the outstanding stock entitled to vote`)
            ELSE NOTHING


§ `Section 154: determination of amount of capital; capital, surplus and net assets`

-- Section 154. The board may determine by resolution that only part of the consideration is capital; absent a timely determination the capital is the aggregate par value plus the consideration for shares without par value.
@export How much of the consideration for these shares is capital (s 154)?
GIVEN `the consideration received for the shares` IS A NUMBER @desc How much consideration did the corporation receive for the shares, in dollars?
      `the aggregate par value of the shares with a par value` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the aggregate par value of the shares that have a par value, in dollars (0 if none)?
      `the consideration for the shares without par value` IS A NUMBER @desc How much of the consideration was for shares without par value, in dollars (0 if none)?
      `all the shares issued for the consideration have a par value` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do all the shares issued for the consideration have a par value?
      `the shares were issued for cash` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were the shares issued for cash (rather than other consideration)?
      `the day the shares were issued` IS A DATE @desc On what day were the shares issued (YYYY-MM-DD)?
      `the board determined by resolution the part that is capital` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the board of directors determine by resolution the part of the consideration that is capital?
      `the amount the board determined to be capital` IS A NUMBER @desc If so, how much did it determine to be capital, in dollars (0 if it did not)?
      `the day the board determined it` IS A DATE @desc If so, on what day did it determine it (YYYY-MM-DD; any date if it did not)?
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `How much of the consideration for these shares is capital` IS
    `s 154 the capital in respect of the shares` `our facts`
    WHERE
        `our facts` MEANS `s 154 Facts about the capital for shares issued` WITH
            `the consideration received for the shares` IS `the consideration received for the shares`
            `the aggregate par value of the shares having a par value` IS `the aggregate par value of the shares with a par value`
            `the consideration for the shares without par value` IS `the consideration for the shares without par value`
            `all the shares issued for the consideration are shares having a par value` IS `all the shares issued for the consideration have a par value`
            `the shares were issued for cash` IS `the shares were issued for cash`
            `the day the shares were issued` IS `the day the shares were issued`
            `the determination of the board, if it made one` IS
                IF `the board determined by resolution the part that is capital`
                THEN JUST (`s 154 A determination by the board of the part that is capital` WITH
                               `the amount in dollars the board determined to be capital` IS `the amount the board determined to be capital`
                               `the day the board determined it` IS `the day the board determined it`)
                ELSE NOTHING

@export What is the stated capital of shares without par value (s 154)?
GIVEN `the amount of the consideration determined to be capital in respect of the shares without par value` IS A NUMBER @desc How much of the consideration for the shares without par value was determined to be capital, in dollars?
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `What is the stated capital of shares without par value` IS
    `s 154 the stated capital of the shares without par value` `the amount of the consideration determined to be capital in respect of the shares without par value`

@export What would our capital be if the board transfers part of the net assets to the capital account (s 154)?
GIVEN `the capital before the transfer` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the corporation's capital before the transfer, in dollars?
      `the net assets of the corporation` IS A NUMBER @desc What are the corporation's net assets, in dollars?
      `the portion the board directs be transferred` IS A NUMBER @desc What portion of the net assets does the board direct be transferred to the capital account, in dollars?
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `What would our capital be if the board transfers part of the net assets to the capital account` IS
    `s 154 the capital after a transfer from the net assets` `the capital before the transfer` `the net assets of the corporation` `the portion the board directs be transferred`

@export What are the net assets of our corporation (s 154)?
GIVEN `the total assets of the corporation` IS A NUMBER @desc What are the corporation's total assets, in dollars?
      `the total liabilities, not counting capital and surplus` IS A NUMBER @desc What are the corporation's total liabilities, in dollars, not counting capital and surplus?
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `What are the net assets of our corporation` IS
    `s 154 the net assets of the corporation` `the total assets of the corporation` `the total liabilities, not counting capital and surplus`

@export What is the surplus of our corporation, if any (s 154)?
GIVEN `the total assets of the corporation` IS A NUMBER @desc What are the corporation's total assets, in dollars?
      `the total liabilities, not counting capital and surplus` IS A NUMBER @desc What are the corporation's total liabilities, in dollars, not counting capital and surplus?
      `the capital of the corporation` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the corporation's capital, in dollars (0 for a nonstock corporation)?
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `What is the surplus of our corporation, if any` IS
    `s 154 the surplus of the corporation, if any` (`s 154 the net assets of the corporation` `the total assets of the corporation` `the total liabilities, not counting capital and surplus`) `the capital of the corporation`

@export What is the capital of our corporation for sections 154, 160 and 170 (s 154)?
GIVEN `the kind of our corporation` IS A `Kind of corporation` @desc What kind of corporation is it? One of: a stock corporation; a nonstock corporation with membership interests; a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable; a charitable nonstock corporation.
      `the capital worked out as for a stock corporation` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the capital worked out as for a stock corporation, in dollars?
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `What is the capital of our corporation for sections 154, 160 and 170` IS
    `s 154 the capital to use in sections 154, 160 and 170` `the kind of our corporation` `the capital worked out as for a stock corporation`

§ `Section 155: fractions of shares`

@export Has our corporation dealt with fractional interests as the Law requires (s 155)?
GIVEN `our corporation issues fractions of a share` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the corporation issue fractions of a share?
      `we arranged for the disposition of fractional interests by those entitled` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the corporation arrange for the disposition of fractional interests by those entitled to them?
      `the cash we paid for the fractions` IS A NUMBER @desc How much cash did the corporation pay for the fractions, in dollars (0 if none)?
      `the fair value of the fractions` IS A NUMBER @desc What was the fair value of the fractions as of the time those entitled to them were determined, in dollars?
      `we issued scrip or warrants for a full share` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the corporation issue scrip or warrants in registered form that entitle the holder to a full share on surrender of scrip or warrants aggregating a full share?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Has our corporation dealt with fractional interests as the Law requires` IF
    `s 155 the corporation has dealt with fractional interests as the section requires` `our corporation issues fractions of a share` `we arranged for the disposition of fractional interests by those entitled` `the cash we paid for the fractions` `the fair value of the fractions` `we issued scrip or warrants for a full share`

@export Can I vote, receive dividends or share in liquidation with my fractional interest (s 155)?
GIVEN `what I hold` IS A `s 155 What the holder of a fractional interest holds` @desc What do you hold? One of: a certificate for a fractional share under s 155; an uncertificated fractional share under s 155; scrip or warrants under s 155.
      `the right I ask about` IS A `s 155 A right a fractional interest may carry` @desc Which right do you ask about? One of: the right to exercise voting rights under s 155; the right to receive dividends under s 155; the right to participate in the assets of the corporation in the event of liquidation under s 155.
      `my scrip or warrants say they carry the right` IS A BOOLEAN @desc If you hold scrip or warrants: do their own terms provide that they carry that right (answer false if you hold a fractional share)?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Can I exercise this right with my fractional interest` IF
    `s 155 the holder of the fractional interest is entitled to the right` `what I hold` `the right I ask about` `my scrip or warrants say they carry the right`

@export Have my scrip or warrants become void (s 155)?
GIVEN `they carry a condition that they become void if not exchanged before a date` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do the scrip or warrants carry a condition that they become void if not exchanged for full shares before a specified date?
      `I exchanged them for full shares` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you exchange them for certificates or uncertificated full shares?
      `the day I exchanged them` IS A DATE @desc If so, on what day (YYYY-MM-DD; any date if you did not)?
      `the specified date` IS A DATE @desc What is the specified date (YYYY-MM-DD)?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Have my scrip or warrants become void` IF
    `s 155 the scrip or warrants have become void` `they carry a condition that they become void if not exchanged before a date` (IF `I exchanged them for full shares` THEN JUST `the day I exchanged them` ELSE NOTHING) `the specified date`

@export May our board cause scrip or warrants to be issued subject to this condition (s 155)?
GIVEN `we issue scrip or warrants in registered form in lieu of fractions` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the corporation issuing scrip or warrants in registered form in lieu of fractions of a share, entitling the holder to a full share on surrender of scrip or warrants aggregating a full share?
      `the condition` IS A `s 155 A condition on which scrip or warrants may be issued` @desc Which condition? One of: that they become void if not exchanged for full shares before a specified date under s 155; that the shares for which they are exchangeable may be sold and the proceeds distributed to the holders under s 155; any other condition which the board of directors may impose under s 155.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May our board cause scrip or warrants to be issued subject to this condition` IF
    `s 155 the board may cause scrip or warrants to be issued subject to the condition` `we issue scrip or warrants in registered form in lieu of fractions` `the condition`

§ `Section 156: partly paid shares`

@export Does my partly paid share carry the statement of the consideration and the amount paid that the Law requires (s 156)?
GIVEN `my shares are represented by a certificate` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the partly paid shares represented by a certificate?
      `the face or back of the certificate states the amounts` IS A BOOLEAN @desc If so, does the face or back of the certificate state the total consideration to be paid and the amount paid?
      `the books and records state the amounts` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do the corporation's books and records state the total consideration to be paid and the amount paid?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Does my partly paid share carry the statement the Law requires` IF
    `s 156 the total consideration and the amount paid are stated as the section requires` `my shares are represented by a certificate` `the face or back of the certificate states the amounts` `the books and records state the amounts`

@export What dividend am I entitled to on a partly paid share when a dividend is declared on fully paid shares (s 156)?
GIVEN `the dividend declared on each fully paid share` IS A NUMBER @desc What dividend is declared on each fully paid share of the same class, in dollars?
      `the total consideration to be paid for my partly paid share` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the total consideration to be paid for each of your partly paid shares, in dollars?
      `the amount paid on my partly paid share` IS A NUMBER @desc How much have you paid on each of them, in dollars?
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `What dividend am I entitled to on a partly paid share` IS
    `s 156 the dividend on each partly paid share` `the dividend declared on each fully paid share` `the total consideration to be paid for my partly paid share` `the amount paid on my partly paid share`

§ `Section 157: rights and options respecting stock`

@export May our corporation create and issue rights or options to acquire its stock (s 157(a))?
GIVEN `our certificate forbids the creation or issue of the rights or options` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does a provision of the certificate of incorporation forbid the creation or issue of the rights or options?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May our corporation create and issue rights or options to acquire its stock` IF
    `s 157(a) the corporation may create and issue the rights or options` `our certificate forbids the creation or issue of the rights or options`

@export Are our rights or options issued, and their terms stated, as the Law requires (s 157(b))?
GIVEN `a board resolution sets out the numbers, times and consideration of the rights or options` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does a resolution of the board set out the numbers, the times and the consideration for which the rights or options are issued?
      `where the terms of exercise are stated` IS A `Where a provision is made` @desc Where are the terms on which shares may be acquired on exercise stated? One of: in the certificate of incorporation; in a resolution of the board of directors; in the bylaws; in none of these.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Are our rights or options issued and their terms stated as the Law requires` IF
    `s 157(b) the rights or options are issued and their terms stated as that subsection requires` `a board resolution sets out the numbers, times and consideration of the rights or options` `where the terms of exercise are stated`

@export May our board delegate the issue of rights or options to a person or body (s 157(c))?
GIVEN `the resolution fixes the maximum number of shares issuable on exercise` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the resolution fix the maximum number of shares issuable on exercise of the rights or options?
      `the resolution fixes the time periods` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it fix a time period for issuing the rights or options and a time period for issuing the shares on exercise?
      `the resolution fixes the minimum consideration, if any` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it fix the minimum consideration (if any) for the rights or options and for the shares issuable on exercise?
      `the resolution lets the delegate issue rights or options to itself` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it permit the person or body to issue rights or options to itself?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May our board delegate the issue of rights or options to a person or body` IF
    `s 157(c) the resolution validly delegates the authority to issue rights or options` `the resolution fixes the maximum number of shares issuable on exercise` `the resolution fixes the time periods` `the resolution fixes the minimum consideration, if any` `the resolution lets the delegate issue rights or options to itself`

@export Is this issue of rights or options within the resolution that delegated the authority to issue them (s 157(c))?
GIVEN `the maximum number of shares issuable on exercise the resolution allows` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the maximum number of shares issuable on exercise of the rights or options under the resolution?
      `the first day for issuing the rights or options` IS A DATE @desc What is the first day the resolution allows for issuing the rights or options (YYYY-MM-DD)?
      `the last day for issuing the rights or options` IS A DATE @desc What is the last day (YYYY-MM-DD)?
      `the first day for issuing the shares on exercise` IS A DATE @desc What is the first day the resolution allows for issuing the shares on exercise (YYYY-MM-DD)?
      `the last day for issuing the shares on exercise` IS A DATE @desc What is the last day (YYYY-MM-DD)?
      `the resolution fixes a minimum consideration for the rights or options` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the resolution fix a minimum consideration for the rights or options?
      `the minimum consideration for the rights or options` IS A NUMBER @desc If so, what is it, in dollars (0 if none), in the resolution's own unit?
      `the minimum consideration for the shares on exercise` IS A NUMBER @desc What minimum consideration for the shares issuable on exercise does the resolution fix, in dollars, in the resolution's own unit?
      `the shares already covered by rights or options issued under the resolution` IS A NUMBER @desc How many shares are issuable on exercise of the rights or options already issued under the resolution?
      `the shares covered by this issue` IS A NUMBER @desc How many shares are issuable on exercise of this issue?
      `the day the rights or options are issued` IS A DATE @desc On what day are they issued (YYYY-MM-DD)?
      `the day the shares are to be issued on exercise` IS A DATE @desc On what day are the shares to be issued on exercise (YYYY-MM-DD)?
      `the consideration for the rights or options` IS A NUMBER @desc What consideration is received for the rights or options, in dollars, in the same unit?
      `the consideration for the shares on exercise` IS A NUMBER @desc What consideration is to be received for the shares on exercise, in dollars, in the same unit?
      `they are issued to the delegate itself` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the rights or options issued to the person or body that is issuing them?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is this issue of rights or options within the resolution that delegated the authority to issue them` IF
    `s 157(c) the issue of rights or options is within the delegating resolution` `our resolution` `this issue`
    WHERE
        `our resolution` MEANS `s 157(c) A delegating resolution` WITH
            `the maximum number of shares issuable upon exercise` IS `the maximum number of shares issuable on exercise the resolution allows`
            `the first day for issuing the rights or options` IS `the first day for issuing the rights or options`
            `the last day for issuing the rights or options` IS `the last day for issuing the rights or options`
            `the first day for issuing the shares on exercise` IS `the first day for issuing the shares on exercise`
            `the last day for issuing the shares on exercise` IS `the last day for issuing the shares on exercise`
            `the minimum consideration for the rights or options, if any` IS
                IF `the resolution fixes a minimum consideration for the rights or options` THEN JUST `the minimum consideration for the rights or options` ELSE NOTHING
            `the minimum consideration for the shares on exercise` IS `the minimum consideration for the shares on exercise`
        `this issue` MEANS `s 157(c) One issue of rights or options under a delegating resolution` WITH
            `the number of shares issuable upon exercise of those already issued` IS `the shares already covered by rights or options issued under the resolution`
            `the number of shares issuable upon exercise of this issue` IS `the shares covered by this issue`
            `the day the rights or options are issued` IS `the day the rights or options are issued`
            `the day the shares are to be issued on exercise` IS `the day the shares are to be issued on exercise`
            `the consideration for the rights or options` IS `the consideration for the rights or options`
            `the consideration for the shares on exercise` IS `the consideration for the shares on exercise`
            `the rights or options are issued to the person or body that issues them` IS `they are issued to the delegate itself`

@export May a provision of our board's resolution on rights or options depend on facts outside the resolution (s 157(d))?
GIVEN `the resolution is one the board adopts to issue rights or options or to delegate their issue` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the resolution one contemplated by section 157(b) or (c)?
      `a provision depends on facts outside the resolution` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does a provision of the resolution depend on facts ascertainable outside it?
      `the resolution says how those facts operate` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the resolution clearly and expressly set forth the manner in which those facts operate on it?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May a provision of our board's resolution on rights or options depend on facts outside the resolution` IF
    `s 157(d) the provision may be made dependent on facts ascertainable outside the resolution` `the resolution is one the board adopts to issue rights or options or to delegate their issue` `a provision depends on facts outside the resolution` `the resolution says how those facts operate`

@export Is the occurrence of an event, or someone's determination or action, a "fact" for a resolution under section 157 (s 157(d))?
GIVEN `the matter is an event, or a determination or action by a person or body` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the matter the occurrence of an event, including a determination or action by any person or body (the corporation included)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is the matter a fact for a resolution under section 157` IS
    `s 157(d) the matter is a fact for the purposes of that section` `the matter is an event, or a determination or action by a person or body`

@export May the limits we fixed for the delegate of rights or options depend on the delegate's own determination or action (s 157(d))?
GIVEN `the resolution delegates the authority to issue rights or options` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the resolution delegate to a person or body the authority to issue rights or options under section 157(c)?
      `a limit depends on the delegate's own determination or action` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the provision on the maximum number, the time periods or the minimum consideration made dependent on a determination or action by that person or body?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May the limits fixed for the delegate of rights or options depend on the delegate's own determination or action` IF
    `s 157(d) the limits fixed under subsection (c) may be made dependent on the delegate` `the resolution delegates the authority to issue rights or options` `a limit depends on the delegate's own determination or action`

@export Is the minimum consideration for shares issued on exercise at least what section 153 requires (s 157(e))?
GIVEN `the minimum consideration fixed for the shares issuable on exercise` IS A NUMBER @desc What minimum consideration is fixed for the shares issuable on exercise, in dollars, for all those shares?
      `the shares have a par value` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do the shares have a par value?
      `the par value of each share` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the par value of each share, in dollars (0 if the shares have none)?
      `the number of shares` IS A NUMBER @desc How many shares are issuable on exercise?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is the minimum consideration for shares issued on exercise at least what section 153 requires` IF
    `s 157(e) the minimum consideration on exercise is not less than that section 153 requires` `the minimum consideration fixed for the shares issuable on exercise` (`s 153 the consideration required for the shares, if any` `the shares have a par value` `the par value of each share` `the number of shares`)

§ `Section 158: stock certificates; uncertificated shares`

@export Are my shares uncertificated shares (s 158)?
GIVEN `the board resolved that the shares of my class or series are uncertificated` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the board of directors resolve that some or all of the shares of my class or series shall be uncertificated shares, including mine?
      `my shares are represented by a certificate` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are my shares represented by a certificate?
      `I have surrendered my certificate to the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have you surrendered the certificate to the corporation?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Are my shares uncertificated shares` IF
    `s 158 the shares are uncertificated shares` `the board resolved that the shares of my class or series are uncertificated` `my shares are represented by a certificate` `I have surrendered my certificate to the corporation`

@export Am I entitled to a stock certificate (s 158)?
GIVEN `my stock is represented by certificates` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the stock you hold represented by certificates (rather than uncertificated)?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Am I entitled to a stock certificate` IF
    `s 158 the holder is entitled to a certificate` `my stock is represented by certificates`

@export Is my certificate signed as the Law requires (s 158)?
GIVEN `the number of authorised officers who signed my certificate` IS A NUMBER @desc How many authorised officers signed your certificate or have it issued in the corporation's name, counting facsimile signatures and officers (or transfer agents or registrars) who ceased to hold that position before it was issued?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is my certificate signed as the Law requires` IF
    `s 158 the certificate is signed as the section requires` `the number of authorised officers who signed my certificate`

@export Has the corporation power to issue a certificate in bearer form (s 158)?
GIVEN `the certificate is in bearer form` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the certificate in bearer form?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Has the corporation power to issue a certificate in bearer form` IF
    `s 158 the corporation has power to issue the certificate` `the certificate is in bearer form`


§ `Section 159: shares of stock; personal property, transfer and taxation`

@export Are my shares of stock personal property (s 159)?
GIVEN `my property is shares of stock in a corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the property shares of stock in a corporation?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Are my shares of stock personal property` IF
    `s 159 the shares are deemed personal property` `my property is shares of stock in a corporation`

@export Are my shares transferable by this transfer (s 159)?
GIVEN `the transfer is made as Article 8 of subtitle I of Title 6 provides` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the transfer made as Article 8 of subtitle I of Title 6 (the Delaware Uniform Commercial Code, investment securities) provides?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Are my shares transferable by this transfer` IF
    `s 159 the shares are transferable by that transfer` `the transfer is made as Article 8 of subtitle I of Title 6 provides`

@export Is my stock or are my bonds exempt from taxation by Delaware (s 159)?
GIVEN `issued by a corporation organized under the General Corporation Law` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were the stock or bonds issued by a corporation organized under the General Corporation Law?
      `I am a nonresident of Delaware` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a nonresident of Delaware?
      `I am a foreign corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a foreign corporation?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is my stock or are my bonds exempt from taxation by Delaware` IS
    `s 159 the stock or bonds are exempt from taxation by this State` `issued by a corporation organized under the General Corporation Law` `I am a nonresident of Delaware` `I am a foreign corporation`

@export Must the entry of transfer say that my transfer is for collateral security (s 159)?
GIVEN `the transfer is for collateral security and not absolutely` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the transfer of the shares made for collateral security and not absolutely?
      `the transferor and the transferee both ask the corporation to say so` IS A BOOLEAN @desc When the certificates were presented (or the transfer of uncertificated shares requested), did the transferor and the transferee both ask the corporation to express that in the entry of transfer?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Must the entry of transfer say that the transfer is for collateral security` IF
    `s 159 the entry of transfer must express that the transfer is for collateral security` `the transfer is for collateral security and not absolutely` `the transferor and the transferee both ask the corporation to say so`

§ `Section 160: corporation's powers respecting its own stock; rights of stock called for redemption`

@export Is our corporation barred from buying or redeeming its own shares for cash or other property (s 160(a)(1))?
GIVEN `the kind of our corporation` IS A `Kind of corporation` @desc What kind of corporation is it? One of: a stock corporation; a nonstock corporation with membership interests; a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable; a charitable nonstock corporation.
      `our capital is impaired` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the capital of the corporation impaired?
      `the purchase or redemption would impair our capital` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would the purchase or redemption cause any impairment of the capital?
      `the shares have a preference on distribution of assets` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the shares entitled, on any distribution of assets (by dividend or in liquidation), to a preference over another class or series?
      `no shares with such a preference are outstanding` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are no shares with such a preference outstanding?
      `the shares will be retired when acquired` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Will the shares be retired on their acquisition?
      `the capital is reduced under sections 243 and 244` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the capital reduced in accordance with sections 243 and 244?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is our corporation barred from buying or redeeming its own shares for cash or other property` IF
    `s 160(a)(1) the purchase or redemption is barred` `our purchase`
    WHERE
        `our purchase` MEANS `s 160(a)(1) Facts about a purchase or redemption of the corporation's own shares` WITH
            `the kind of corporation` IS `the kind of our corporation`
            `the capital of the corporation is impaired` IS `our capital is impaired`
            `the purchase or redemption would cause an impairment of the capital` IS `the purchase or redemption would impair our capital`
            `the shares are entitled upon any distribution of assets, by dividend or in liquidation, to a preference over another class or series` IS `the shares have a preference on distribution of assets`
            `no shares entitled to such a preference are outstanding` IS `no shares with such a preference are outstanding`
            `the shares will be retired upon their acquisition` IS `the shares will be retired when acquired`
            `the capital of the corporation is reduced in accordance with sections 243 and 244` IS `the capital is reduced under sections 243 and 244`

@export Is a note or debenture our corporation gave for shares it bought still valid (s 160(a)(1))?
GIVEN `our capital was not impaired when the note was delivered` IS A BOOLEAN @desc When the note, debenture or other obligation was delivered, was the capital not then impaired?
      `our capital did not become impaired by the note` IS A BOOLEAN @desc At that time, did the capital not thereby become impaired?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is a note or debenture our corporation gave for shares it bought still valid` IF
    `s 160(a)(1) the note, debenture or obligation given for the acquisition is not invalidated` `our capital was not impaired when the note was delivered` `our capital did not become impaired by the note`

@export Is our corporation barred from buying shares redeemable at its option for more than the redemption price (s 160(a)(2))?
GIVEN `the shares are redeemable at the option of the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the shares redeemable at the option of the corporation?
      `the price we would pay` IS A NUMBER @desc What price would the corporation pay, in dollars?
      `the price at which the shares may then be redeemed` IS A NUMBER @desc At what price may they then be redeemed, in dollars?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is our corporation barred from buying shares redeemable at its option for more than the redemption price` IF
    `s 160(a)(2) the purchase is barred` `the shares are redeemable at the option of the corporation` `the price we would pay` `the price at which the shares may then be redeemed`

@export Is our corporation barred from redeeming these shares or membership interests (s 160(a)(3))?
GIVEN `the kind of our corporation` IS A `Kind of corporation` @desc What kind of corporation is it? One of: a stock corporation; a nonstock corporation with membership interests; a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable; a charitable nonstock corporation.
      `how the redemption is triggered` IS A `s 151(b) How a redemption is triggered` @desc (Stock corporation) How is the redemption triggered? One of: at the option of the corporation under s 151(b); at the option of the holders of the stock under s 151(b); upon the happening of a specified event under s 151(b).
      `full voting shares will remain outstanding` IS A BOOLEAN @desc (Stock corporation) Immediately after the redemption, will 1 or more shares of 1 or more classes or series with full voting powers be outstanding?
      `the stock is stock of a registered investment company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc (Stock corporation) Is the stock stock of a regulated investment company registered under the Investment Company Act of 1940?
      `the licence, franchise or exchange membership depends on holders' qualifications` IS A BOOLEAN @desc (Stock corporation) Does the corporation hold a licence or franchise from a governmental agency, or belong to a national securities exchange, conditioned on holders of its stock having prescribed qualifications?
      `the redemption is only to the extent necessary to keep that licence, franchise or membership` IS A BOOLEAN @desc (Stock corporation) Is the redemption only to the extent necessary to prevent the loss of it, or to reinstate it?
      `the redemption follows section 151(b) and the certificate` IS A BOOLEAN @desc (Stock corporation) Is the redemption made in accordance with section 151(b) and the certificate of incorporation?
      `the certificate authorises the redemption of membership interests` IS A BOOLEAN @desc (Nonstock corporation) Does the certificate of incorporation authorise the redemption of the membership interests?
      `the redemption of membership interests follows the certificate` IS A BOOLEAN @desc (Nonstock corporation) Is the redemption made in accordance with the certificate of incorporation?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is our corporation barred from redeeming these shares or membership interests` IF
    `s 160(a)(3) the redemption is barred` `the kind of our corporation` `our redemption terms` `the redemption follows section 151(b) and the certificate` `the certificate authorises the redemption of membership interests` `the redemption of membership interests follows the certificate`
    WHERE
        `our redemption terms` MEANS `s 151(b) Redemption terms` WITH
            `how the redemption is triggered` IS `how the redemption is triggered`
            `immediately following the redemption 1 or more shares of 1 or more classes or series with full voting powers will be outstanding` IS `full voting shares will remain outstanding`
            `the stock is stock of a regulated investment company registered under the Investment Company Act of 1940` IS `the stock is stock of a registered investment company`
            `the corporation holds a licence or franchise from a governmental agency to conduct its business, or is a member of a national securities exchange, conditioned on holders of its stock possessing prescribed qualifications` IS `the licence, franchise or exchange membership depends on holders' qualifications`
            `the redemption is to the extent necessary to prevent the loss of the licence, franchise or membership or to reinstate it` IS `the redemption is only to the extent necessary to keep that licence, franchise or membership`

@export May our corporation still resell shares it bought or redeemed out of surplus (s 160(b))?
GIVEN `the shares were purchased or redeemed out of surplus` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were the shares purchased or redeemed out of surplus?
      `the shares have been retired` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have the shares been retired?
      `our certificate requires them to be retired` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the certificate of incorporation require them to be retired?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May our corporation still resell shares it bought or redeemed out of surplus` IF
    `s 160(b) the corporation's right to resell the shares under section 153(c) is unaffected` `the shares were purchased or redeemed out of surplus` `the shares have been retired` `our certificate requires them to be retired`

-- Section 160(c). Shares that belong to the corporation, or to an entity it controls, neither vote nor count for a quorum.
@export Can shares held by the corporation, or by an entity it controls, be voted (s 160(c))?
GIVEN `who holds the shares` IS A `s 160(c) Who holds the shares` @desc Who holds the shares? One of: the corporation itself under s 160(c); another corporation under s 160(c); any other entity under s 160(c); a holder that is neither the corporation, a corporation it controls nor an entity it controls under s 160(c).
      `the corporation holds a majority of the other corporation's shares entitled to vote for directors` IS A BOOLEAN @desc (Another corporation) Does the corporation hold, directly or indirectly, a majority of the shares entitled to vote in the election of that corporation's directors?
      `the corporation holds a majority of the other entity's voting power` IS A BOOLEAN @desc (Any other entity) Does the corporation hold, directly or indirectly, a majority of the voting power of that entity?
      `the corporation otherwise controls the other entity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc (Any other entity) Is that entity otherwise controlled, directly or indirectly, by the corporation?
      `the holder holds the shares in a fiduciary capacity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the holder hold the shares in a fiduciary capacity?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Can shares held by the corporation or by an entity it controls be voted` IS
    `s 160(c) the shares may be voted, as far as this section decides` `our shares`
    WHERE
        `our shares` MEANS `s 160(c) Facts about shares of the corporation's capital stock` WITH
            `who holds the shares` IS `who holds the shares`
            `a majority of the shares entitled to vote in the election of directors of the other corporation is held, directly or indirectly, by the corporation` IS `the corporation holds a majority of the other corporation's shares entitled to vote for directors`
            `a majority of the voting power of the other entity is held, directly or indirectly, by the corporation` IS `the corporation holds a majority of the other entity's voting power`
            `the other entity is otherwise controlled, directly or indirectly, by the corporation` IS `the corporation otherwise controls the other entity`
            `the holder holds the shares in a fiduciary capacity` IS `the holder holds the shares in a fiduciary capacity`

@export Do shares held by the corporation, or by an entity it controls, count toward a quorum (s 160(c))?
GIVEN `who holds the shares` IS A `s 160(c) Who holds the shares` @desc Who holds the shares? One of: the corporation itself under s 160(c); another corporation under s 160(c); any other entity under s 160(c); a holder that is neither the corporation, a corporation it controls nor an entity it controls under s 160(c).
      `the corporation holds a majority of the other corporation's shares entitled to vote for directors` IS A BOOLEAN @desc (Another corporation) Does the corporation hold, directly or indirectly, a majority of the shares entitled to vote in the election of that corporation's directors?
      `the corporation holds a majority of the other entity's voting power` IS A BOOLEAN @desc (Any other entity) Does the corporation hold, directly or indirectly, a majority of the voting power of that entity?
      `the corporation otherwise controls the other entity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc (Any other entity) Is that entity otherwise controlled, directly or indirectly, by the corporation?
      `the holder holds the shares in a fiduciary capacity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the holder hold the shares in a fiduciary capacity?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Do shares held by the corporation or by an entity it controls count toward a quorum` IS
    `s 160(c) the shares are counted for quorum purposes, as far as this section decides` `our shares`
    WHERE
        `our shares` MEANS `s 160(c) Facts about shares of the corporation's capital stock` WITH
            `who holds the shares` IS `who holds the shares`
            `a majority of the shares entitled to vote in the election of directors of the other corporation is held, directly or indirectly, by the corporation` IS `the corporation holds a majority of the other corporation's shares entitled to vote for directors`
            `a majority of the voting power of the other entity is held, directly or indirectly, by the corporation` IS `the corporation holds a majority of the other entity's voting power`
            `the other entity is otherwise controlled, directly or indirectly, by the corporation` IS `the corporation otherwise controls the other entity`
            `the holder holds the shares in a fiduciary capacity` IS `the holder holds the shares in a fiduciary capacity`

@export Are my shares, called for redemption, still outstanding for voting on this day (s 160(d))?
GIVEN `the day in question` IS A DATE @desc On what day (YYYY-MM-DD)?
      `notice of redemption was sent to me` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has notice of redemption been sent to the holders?
      `the day the notice was sent` IS A DATE @desc If so, on what day (YYYY-MM-DD; any date if not)?
      `a sum to redeem the shares was irrevocably set aside` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has a sum sufficient to redeem the shares been irrevocably deposited or set aside to pay the redemption price?
      `the day the sum was set aside` IS A DATE @desc If so, on what day (YYYY-MM-DD; any date if not)?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Are my shares called for redemption still outstanding for voting on this day` IF
    NOT (`s 160(d) the shares called for redemption are not outstanding for voting on the day` `the day in question` (IF `notice of redemption was sent to me` THEN JUST `the day the notice was sent` ELSE NOTHING) (IF `a sum to redeem the shares was irrevocably set aside` THEN JUST `the day the sum was set aside` ELSE NOTHING))

§ `Section 161: issuance of additional stock; when and by whom`

@export May our directors issue, or take subscriptions for, additional shares (s 161)?
GIVEN `the number of shares our certificate authorises` IS A NUMBER @desc How many shares does the certificate of incorporation authorise the corporation to issue?
      `the number of shares already issued, subscribed for or committed` IS A NUMBER @desc How many of them have already been issued, subscribed for or otherwise committed to be issued?
      `the number of additional shares` IS A NUMBER @desc How many additional shares do the directors want to issue or take subscriptions for?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May our directors issue or take subscriptions for additional shares` IF
    `s 161 the directors may issue or take subscriptions for the additional shares` `the number of shares our certificate authorises` `the number of shares already issued, subscribed for or committed` `the number of additional shares`

§ `Section 162: liability of stockholder or subscriber for stock not paid in full`

@export Am I bound to pay the unpaid balance on my shares (s 162(a))?
GIVEN `the consideration for my shares has not all been paid in` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the whole of the consideration payable for the shares not been paid in?
      `the assets are insufficient to satisfy the claims of the creditors` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the corporation's assets insufficient to satisfy the claims of its creditors?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Am I bound to pay the unpaid balance on my shares` IF
    `s 162(a) the holder of or subscriber for the shares is bound to pay the unpaid balance` `the consideration for my shares has not all been paid in` `the assets are insufficient to satisfy the claims of the creditors`

@export How much must I pay to complete the unpaid balance on my shares (s 162(a))?
GIVEN `the number of shares I hold or subscribed for` IS A NUMBER @desc How many shares do you hold or have you subscribed for?
      `the unpaid balance on each share` IS A NUMBER @desc How much of the consideration remains unpaid on each share, in dollars?
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `How much must I pay to complete the unpaid balance on my shares` IS
    `s 162(a) the sum the holder or subscriber is bound to pay` `the number of shares I hold or subscribed for` `the unpaid balance on each share`

@export Can the amount I owe be recovered from me as section 325 provides (s 162(b))?
GIVEN `I am bound to pay under section 162(a)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you bound to pay under section 162(a)?
      `a writ of execution against the corporation was returned unsatisfied` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has a writ of execution against the corporation been returned unsatisfied as provided in section 325?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Can the amount I owe be recovered from me as section 325 provides` IF
    `s 162(b) the amount payable may be recovered as provided in section 325` `I am bound to pay under section 162(a)` `a writ of execution against the corporation was returned unsatisfied`

@export Am I free of personal liability for the unpaid portion because I took the shares as an assignee or transferee (s 162(c))?
GIVEN `I took the shares or subscription in good faith` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you become an assignee or transferee of the shares or of a subscription in good faith?
      `I had no knowledge or notice that the consideration was unpaid` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you become one without knowledge or notice that the full consideration had not been paid?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Am I free of personal liability for the unpaid portion as an assignee or transferee` IF
    `s 162(c) the assignee or transferee is not personally liable for the unpaid portion` `I took the shares or subscription in good faith` `I had no knowledge or notice that the consideration was unpaid`

@export Does the person who transferred the shares to me remain liable for the unpaid portion (s 162(c))?
GIVEN `the transferee is not personally liable under section 162(c)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the assignee or transferee protected from personal liability by section 162(c)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Does the transferor remain liable for the unpaid portion` IS
    `s 162(c) the transferor remains liable for the unpaid portion` `the transferee is not personally liable under section 162(c)`

@export Am I personally liable as a stockholder because I hold shares as collateral or as a fiduciary (s 162(d))?
GIVEN `the capacity in which I hold the shares` IS A `s 162(d) The capacity in which a person holds shares` @desc In what capacity do you hold the shares? One of: as collateral security under s 162(d); as an executor, administrator, guardian, trustee or other fiduciary under s 162(d); in another capacity under s 162(d).
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Am I personally liable as a stockholder` IS
    `s 162(d) the person holding the shares is personally liable as a stockholder` `the capacity in which I hold the shares`

@export Is the person who pledged the shares to me considered the holder, and liable (s 162(d))?
GIVEN `the capacity in which I hold the shares` IS A `s 162(d) The capacity in which a person holds shares` @desc In what capacity do you hold the shares? One of: as collateral security under s 162(d); as an executor, administrator, guardian, trustee or other fiduciary under s 162(d); in another capacity under s 162(d).
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is the person who pledged the shares to me considered the holder and liable` IF
    `s 162(d) the person pledging the shares is considered the holder and is liable as a stockholder` `the capacity in which I hold the shares`

@export Are the estate or funds I hold as a fiduciary liable for the shares (s 162(d))?
GIVEN `the capacity in which I hold the shares` IS A `s 162(d) The capacity in which a person holds shares` @desc In what capacity do you hold the shares? One of: as collateral security under s 162(d); as an executor, administrator, guardian, trustee or other fiduciary under s 162(d); in another capacity under s 162(d).
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Are the estate or funds I hold as a fiduciary liable for the shares` IF
    `s 162(d) the estate or funds held in the fiduciary capacity are liable` `the capacity in which I hold the shares`

@export Can liability on my shares or subscription still be asserted against me (s 162(e))?
GIVEN `the day the stock was issued or the subscription was made` IS A DATE @desc On what day was the stock issued, or the subscription made, upon which the assessment is sought (YYYY-MM-DD)?
      `the day the liability is asserted` IS A DATE @desc On what day is the liability asserted (YYYY-MM-DD)?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Can liability on my shares or subscription still be asserted against me` IF
    `s 162(e) the liability may be asserted` `the day the stock was issued or the subscription was made` `the day the liability is asserted`

@export May I appear and contest a claim by a receiver, trustee or judgment creditor to assess me (s 162(f))?
GIVEN `the action is for an assessment under section 162` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the action by a receiver or trustee of an insolvent corporation, or by a judgment creditor, to obtain an assessment under section 162?
      `I am a stockholder or subscriber` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a stockholder or subscriber for stock of the insolvent corporation?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May I appear and contest a claim to assess me` IF
    `s 162(f) the stockholder or subscriber may appear and contest the claim` `the action is for an assessment under section 162` `I am a stockholder or subscriber`

§ `Section 163: payment for stock not paid in full`

@export May our directors demand this payment on stock that is not fully paid (s 163)?
GIVEN `the board judges that the business requires the sum` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the board of directors judge that the necessities of the business require the sum?
      `the sums demanded in the whole on each share` IS A NUMBER @desc What sums have been demanded in the whole on each share, with this demand, in dollars?
      `the balance unpaid on each share` IS A NUMBER @desc What balance remains unpaid on each share, in dollars?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May our directors demand this payment on stock that is not fully paid` IF
    `s 163 the directors may demand the payment` `the board judges that the business requires the sum` `the sums demanded in the whole on each share` `the balance unpaid on each share`

@export Is the notice of the payment I was given what the Law requires (s 163)?
GIVEN `the day the notice was given` IS A DATE @desc On what day was the notice given (YYYY-MM-DD)?
      `the day set for the payment` IS A DATE @desc What day is set for the payment (YYYY-MM-DD)?
      `the notice states the time and place` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the notice state the time and place of the payment?
      `the notice was given to every holder at the last known address` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was it given to each holder of or subscriber for stock that is not fully paid, at the last known address?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is the notice of the payment I was given what the Law requires` IF
    `s 163 the notice of the payment is as the section requires` `the day the notice was given` `the day set for the payment` `the notice states the time and place` `the notice was given to every holder at the last known address`

§ `Section 164: failure to pay for stock; remedies`

@export Can the corporation sue me, or sell my shares at public sale, because I did not pay a call (s 164)?
GIVEN `I failed to pay a call when it was due` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you fail to pay an installment or call on your stock, properly demanded by the directors, when it was due?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Can the corporation sue me or sell my shares at public sale because I did not pay a call` IF
    `s 164 the directors may collect the amount by an action at law or sell the delinquent stockholder's shares at public sale` `I failed to pay a call when it was due`

@export Is the notice of the sale of my shares what the Law requires (s 164)?
GIVEN `the day of the sale` IS A DATE @desc On what day is the sale (YYYY-MM-DD)?
      `the day the advertisement appeared` IS A DATE @desc On what day did the advertisement appear (YYYY-MM-DD)?
      `the day the notice was mailed to me` IS A DATE @desc On what day was the notice mailed to you (YYYY-MM-DD)?
      `the notice states the time, place and sum due on each share` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the notice state the time and place of the sale and the sum due on each share?
      `the advertisement was in a newspaper of the registered office's county` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the advertisement appear in a newspaper of the county in Delaware where the corporation's registered office is located?
      `the notice was mailed to my last known post-office address` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the notice mailed to you at your last known post-office address?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is the notice of the sale of my shares what the Law requires` IF
    `s 164 the notice of the sale is as the section requires` `the day of the sale` `the day the advertisement appeared` `the day the notice was mailed to me` `the notice states the time, place and sum due on each share` `the advertisement was in a newspaper of the registered office's county` `the notice was mailed to my last known post-office address`

@export Are my stock and the amount I paid in forfeited to the corporation (s 164)?
GIVEN `no bidder can be had` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Can no bidder be had to pay the amount due on the stock?
      `an action at law was brought` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the corporation brought an action at law to collect the amount?
      `the day the action was brought` IS A DATE @desc If so, on what day (YYYY-MM-DD; any date if not)?
      `the amount was collected by the action` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the amount been collected by the action?
      `the day the amount was collected` IS A DATE @desc If so, on what day (YYYY-MM-DD; any date if not)?
      `the day as of which you ask` IS A DATE @desc As of what day do you ask (YYYY-MM-DD)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Are my stock and the amount I paid in forfeited to the corporation` IS
    `s 164 the stock and the amount previously paid in are forfeited to the corporation` `no bidder can be had` (IF `an action at law was brought` THEN JUST `the day the action was brought` ELSE NOTHING) (IF `the amount was collected by the action` THEN JUST `the day the amount was collected` ELSE NOTHING) `the day as of which you ask`

§ `Sections 165 and 166: subscriptions`

@export Is my subscription for stock of a corporation to be formed irrevocable on the day I want to revoke it (s 165)?
GIVEN `my subscription is for stock of a corporation to be formed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the subscription for stock of a corporation to be formed?
      `its terms provide otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do the terms of the subscription provide otherwise?
      `all the other subscribers consent to my revoking` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do all the other subscribers consent to the revocation?
      `the corporation consents to my revoking` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the corporation consent to the revocation?
      `the day of my subscription` IS A DATE @desc What is the date of the subscription (YYYY-MM-DD)?
      `the day I want to revoke it` IS A DATE @desc On what day do you want to revoke it (YYYY-MM-DD)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is my preincorporation subscription irrevocable on the day I want to revoke it` IS
    `s 165 the subscription is irrevocable on the day of the revocation` `my subscription is for stock of a corporation to be formed` `its terms provide otherwise` `all the other subscribers consent to my revoking` `the corporation consents to my revoking` `the day of my subscription` `the day I want to revoke it`

@export Is the corporation barred from enforcing my subscription against me (s 166)?
GIVEN `my subscription is in writing` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the subscription in writing?
      `it is signed by me or my agent` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it signed by you or by your agent?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is the corporation barred from enforcing my subscription against me` IF
    `s 166 the subscription is not enforceable against the subscriber` `my subscription is in writing` `it is signed by me or my agent`

§ `Sections 167 and 168: lost certificates`

@export May the corporation issue me a new certificate or uncertificated shares in place of the lost one (s 167)?
GIVEN `the certificate was issued by the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the certificate issued by the corporation?
      `it is alleged to have been lost, stolen or destroyed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it alleged to have been lost, stolen or destroyed?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May the corporation issue me a new certificate or uncertificated shares in place of the lost one` IF
    `s 167 the corporation may issue a new certificate or uncertificated shares in place of the certificate` `the certificate was issued by the corporation` `it is alleged to have been lost, stolen or destroyed`

@export May the corporation require me to give a bond before it replaces my lost certificate (s 167)?
GIVEN `it is alleged to have been lost, stolen or destroyed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the certificate alleged to have been lost, stolen or destroyed?
      `I am the owner or the owner's legal representative` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you the owner of the certificate or the owner's legal representative?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May the corporation require me to give a bond before it replaces my lost certificate` IF
    `s 167 the corporation may require the person to give a bond sufficient to indemnify it` `it is alleged to have been lost, stolen or destroyed` `I am the owner or the owner's legal representative`

@export May I apply to the Court of Chancery for an order to show cause why the corporation should not replace my lost certificate (s 168(a))?
GIVEN `the corporation refuses to replace it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the corporation refuse to issue new uncertificated shares or a new certificate?
      `it was issued by the corporation or its predecessor` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the certificate issued by the corporation or by a corporation of which it is the lawful successor?
      `it is alleged to have been lost, stolen or destroyed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the certificate alleged to have been lost, stolen or destroyed?
      `I am the owner or the owner's legal representative` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you the owner of the certificate or the owner's legal representative?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May I apply to the Court of Chancery for an order to show cause` IF
    `s 168(a) the owner may apply to the Court of Chancery for an order to show cause` `the corporation refuses to replace it` `it was issued by the corporation or its predecessor` `it is alleged to have been lost, stolen or destroyed` `I am the owner or the owner's legal representative`

@export Does my complaint state what the Law requires (s 168(a))?
GIVEN `my complaint states the name of the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the complaint state the name of the corporation?
      `the number and date of the certificate are known or ascertainable` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the number and date of the certificate known or ascertainable by you?
      `my complaint states the number and date` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the complaint state the number and date of the certificate?
      `my complaint states the shares and to whom they were issued` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it state the number of shares of stock represented by the certificate and to whom issued?
      `my complaint states the circumstances of the loss` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it state the circumstances attending the loss, theft or destruction?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Does my complaint state what the Law requires` IF
    `s 168(a) the complaint states what the subsection requires` `my complaint states the name of the corporation` `the number and date of the certificate are known or ascertainable` `my complaint states the number and date` `my complaint states the shares and to whom they were issued` `my complaint states the circumstances of the loss`

@export Will the court make an order requiring the corporation to show cause (s 168(a))?
GIVEN `my application is by a complaint that states what the Law requires` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is your application by a complaint that states what section 168(a) requires?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Will the court make an order requiring the corporation to show cause` IF
    `s 168(a) the court shall make an order requiring the corporation to show cause` `my application is by a complaint that states what the Law requires`

@export Was a copy of my complaint and the order served on the corporation in time (s 168(a))?
GIVEN `the day the copy was served` IS A DATE @desc On what day was a copy of the complaint and the order served on the corporation (YYYY-MM-DD)?
      `the day designated in the order` IS A DATE @desc What day is designated in the order for the corporation to show cause (YYYY-MM-DD)?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Was a copy of my complaint and the order served on the corporation in time` IF
    `s 168(a) the service on the corporation is timely` `the day the copy was served` `the day designated in the order`

@export Will the court order the corporation to issue and deliver new uncertificated shares or a new certificate to me (s 168(b))?
GIVEN `the court is satisfied that I am the lawful owner` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the court satisfied that you are the lawful owner of the shares described in the complaint, or any part of them?
      `the court is satisfied that the certificate was lost, stolen or destroyed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the court satisfied that the certificate has been lost, stolen or destroyed?
      `no sufficient cause was shown against it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has no sufficient cause been shown why new uncertificated shares or a new certificate should not be issued?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Will the court order the corporation to issue and deliver new uncertificated shares or a new certificate to me` IF
    `s 168(b) the court shall order the corporation to issue and deliver new uncertificated shares or a new certificate to the plaintiff` `the court is satisfied that I am the lawful owner` `the court is satisfied that the certificate was lost, stolen or destroyed` `no sufficient cause was shown against it`

@export Must I give the corporation a bond before the new shares or certificate are issued and delivered to me (s 168(b))?
GIVEN `the court has ordered the corporation to issue them to me` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the court ordered the corporation to issue new uncertificated shares or a new certificate to you?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Must I give the corporation a bond before the new shares or certificate are issued and delivered to me` IF
    `s 168(b) the plaintiff must give the corporation a bond before the new uncertificated shares or certificate are issued and delivered` `the court has ordered the corporation to issue them to me`

@export What is the most the corporation can be made to pay on a claim after replacing a certificate under a court order (s 168(b))?
GIVEN `the shares or certificate were issued under a court order` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were the new uncertificated shares or certificate issued pursuant to an order of the court under section 168?
      `the amount of the claim` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the amount of the claim made against the corporation, in dollars?
      `the amount specified in the bond` IS A NUMBER @desc What amount is specified in the bond, in dollars?
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `What is the most the corporation can be made to pay on a claim after replacing a certificate under a court order` IS
    `s 168(b) the most the corporation is liable for on the claim` `the shares or certificate were issued under a court order` `the amount of the claim` `the amount specified in the bond`

§ `Section 169: situs of ownership of stock`

@export Is the ownership of my stock regarded as located in Delaware for this purpose (s 169)?
GIVEN `the corporation exists under the laws of Delaware` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the corporation exist under the laws of Delaware, whether organized under the General Corporation Law or otherwise?
      `the purpose I ask about` IS A `s 169 The purpose for which the situs of the ownership of stock is asked about` @desc For what purpose? One of: title under s 169; action under s 169; attachment under s 169; garnishment under s 169; jurisdiction of the courts held in this State under s 169; taxation under s 169; another purpose under s 169.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is the ownership of my stock regarded as located in Delaware for this purpose` IS
    `s 169 the situs of the ownership of the capital stock is regarded as in this State` `the corporation exists under the laws of Delaware` `the purpose I ask about`


§ `Sections 170 and 171: dividends and reserves`

-- Section 170(a). The surplus is worked out by section 154 from the net assets and the capital (for a nonstock corporation the capital is deemed zero).
@export May our directors declare and pay this dividend (s 170(a))?
GIVEN `the kind of our corporation` IS A `Kind of corporation` @desc What kind of corporation is it? One of: a stock corporation; a nonstock corporation with membership interests; a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable; a charitable nonstock corporation.
      `our certificate allows the dividend` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do the restrictions in the certificate of incorporation allow the dividend?
      `the amount of the dividend` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the amount of the dividend, in dollars?
      `our total assets` IS A NUMBER @desc What are the corporation's total assets, in dollars?
      `our total liabilities, not counting capital and surplus` IS A NUMBER @desc What are its total liabilities, in dollars, not counting capital and surplus?
      `our capital worked out as for a stock corporation` IS A NUMBER @desc What is its capital, computed in accordance with sections 154 and 244, in dollars?
      `our net profits for this fiscal year` IS A NUMBER @desc What are its net profits for the fiscal year in which the dividend is declared, in dollars (0 if none)?
      `our net profits for the preceding fiscal year` IS A NUMBER @desc What are its net profits for the preceding fiscal year, in dollars (0 if none)?
      `the capital represented by the outstanding preference stock` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the aggregate amount of the capital represented by the issued and outstanding stock of all classes having a preference upon the distribution of assets, in dollars?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May our directors declare and pay this dividend` IF
    `s 170(a) the directors may declare and pay the dividend` `our dividend`
    WHERE
        `our capital` MEANS `s 154 the capital to use in sections 154, 160 and 170` `the kind of our corporation` `our capital worked out as for a stock corporation`
        `our dividend` MEANS `s 170(a) Facts about a proposed dividend` WITH
            `the restrictions in the certificate of incorporation allow the dividend` IS `our certificate allows the dividend`
            `the amount of the dividend` IS `the amount of the dividend`
            `the surplus, if any, as defined in and computed in accordance with sections 154 and 244` IS `s 154 the surplus of the corporation, if any` (`s 154 the net assets of the corporation` `our total assets` `our total liabilities, not counting capital and surplus`) `our capital`
            `the net profits for the fiscal year in which the dividend is declared` IS `our net profits for this fiscal year`
            `the net profits for the preceding fiscal year` IS `our net profits for the preceding fiscal year`
            `the capital computed in accordance with sections 154 and 244` IS `our capital`
            `the aggregate amount of the capital represented by the issued and outstanding stock of all classes having a preference upon the distribution of assets` IS `the capital represented by the outstanding preference stock`

@export Does a note or debenture paid as a dividend remain valid (s 170(a))?
GIVEN `when it was delivered the corporation had surplus or net profits to pay the dividend lawfully` IS A BOOLEAN @desc At the time the note, debenture or other obligation was delivered, did the corporation have surplus (or net profits) from which the dividend could lawfully have been paid under section 170(a)(1) or (2)?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Does a note or debenture paid as a dividend remain valid` IF
    `s 170(a) the note, debenture or obligation paid as a dividend remains valid` `when it was delivered the corporation had surplus or net profits to pay the dividend lawfully`

@export May our directors determine our net profits without taking depletion of wasting assets into consideration (s 170(b))?
GIVEN `we exploit wasting assets or are mainly liquidating specific assets` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the corporation engaged in the exploitation of wasting assets (natural resources, patents) or primarily in the liquidation of specific assets?
      `our certificate forbids ignoring depletion` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does a restriction in the certificate of incorporation forbid determining the net profits without regard to depletion?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May our directors determine our net profits without taking depletion into consideration` IF
    `s 170(b) the directors may determine the net profits without taking depletion into consideration` `we exploit wasting assets or are mainly liquidating specific assets` `our certificate forbids ignoring depletion`

@export May our directors set apart a reserve out of the funds available for dividends (s 171)?
GIVEN `the funds are available for dividends` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the funds available for dividends?
      `the purpose is a proper purpose` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the purpose of the reserve a proper purpose?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May our directors set apart a reserve out of the funds available for dividends` IF
    `s 171 the directors may set apart a reserve` `the funds are available for dividends` `the purpose is a proper purpose`

@export May our directors abolish a reserve they set apart (s 171)?
GIVEN `the reserve was set apart under section 171` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the reserve set apart under section 171?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May our directors abolish a reserve they set apart` IF
    `s 171 the directors may abolish the reserve` `the reserve was set apart under section 171`

§ `Section 172: protection of directors and committee members`

@export Am I, as a director or committee member, fully protected for relying on what I relied on (s 172)?
GIVEN `I am a member of the board or of a committee the board designated` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a member of the board of directors or of a committee designated by the board?
      `I relied in good faith` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you rely in good faith?
      `what I relied on` IS A `s 172 What the director relied on` @desc What did you rely on? One of: the records of the corporation under s 172; information, opinions, reports or statements presented by an officer or employee under s 172; information, opinions, reports or statements presented by a committee of the board under s 172; information, opinions, reports or statements presented by any other person under s 172.
      `I reasonably believed the matters were within that person's expert competence` IS A BOOLEAN @desc (Any other person) Did you reasonably believe the matters were within that person's professional or expert competence?
      `that person was selected with reasonable care` IS A BOOLEAN @desc (Any other person) Was that person selected with reasonable care by or on behalf of the corporation?
      `it concerned the value of assets, liabilities or net profits, or the funds for dividends or for buying or redeeming stock` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did it concern the value and amount of the assets, liabilities or net profits of the corporation, or another fact pertinent to the existence and amount of surplus or other funds from which dividends might properly be declared and paid, or with which stock might properly be purchased or redeemed?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Am I fully protected for relying on what I relied on` IF
    `s 172 the director or committee member is fully protected` `my reliance`
    WHERE
        `my reliance` MEANS `s 172 Reliance by a director or committee member` WITH
            `the person is a member of the board of directors or of a committee designated by the board` IS `I am a member of the board or of a committee the board designated`
            `the person relied in good faith` IS `I relied in good faith`
            `what the person relied on` IS `what I relied on`
            `the person reasonably believes the matters are within the other person's professional or expert competence` IS `I reasonably believed the matters were within that person's expert competence`
            `the other person was selected with reasonable care by or on behalf of the corporation` IS `that person was selected with reasonable care`
            `the matter is the value and amount of the assets, liabilities or net profits of the corporation, or another fact pertinent to the existence and amount of surplus or other funds from which dividends might properly be declared and paid, or with which the corporation's stock might properly be purchased or redeemed` IS `it concerned the value of assets, liabilities or net profits, or the funds for dividends or for buying or redeeming stock`

§ `Section 173: declaration and payment of dividends`

@export May our corporation pay this dividend in this form (s 173)?
GIVEN `the payment is in accordance with the chapter` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the payment in accordance with the General Corporation Law?
      `the form of the dividend` IS A `s 173 The form of a dividend` @desc In what form is the dividend paid? One of: a dividend in cash under s 173; a dividend in property under s 173; a dividend in shares of the capital stock of the corporation under s 173; a dividend in another form under s 173.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May our corporation pay this dividend in this form` IS
    `s 173 the corporation may pay the dividend` `the payment is in accordance with the chapter` `the form of the dividend`

@export Is the amount our board designated as capital for a dividend paid in shares what the Law requires (s 173)?
GIVEN `the shares are a split-up or division of the stock` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the shares distributed in a split-up or division of the stock, rather than as payment of a dividend declared payable in stock?
      `the board directed by resolution that an amount be designated as capital` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the board of directors direct by resolution that an amount be designated as capital in respect of the shares?
      `the amount designated as capital` IS A NUMBER @desc What amount was designated as capital, in dollars?
      `the aggregate par value of the par value shares` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the aggregate par value of the par value shares being declared as a dividend, in dollars?
      `the board determined the amount for the shares without par value` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the board determine the amount designated for any shares without par value?
      `some shares are without par value` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are there shares without par value among the shares declared as a dividend?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is the amount our board designated as capital for a dividend paid in shares what the Law requires` IF
    `s 173 the designation as capital for a dividend in shares is as the section requires` `the shares are a split-up or division of the stock` `the board directed by resolution that an amount be designated as capital` `the amount designated as capital` `the aggregate par value of the par value shares` `the board determined the amount for the shares without par value` `some shares are without par value`

§ `Section 174: liability of directors for unlawful dividends, purchases and redemptions`

@export Am I liable to the corporation as a director for an unlawful dividend, stock purchase or redemption (s 174(a))?
GIVEN `it violated section 160 or 173` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the dividend, stock purchase or redemption violate section 160 or section 173?
      `the violation was wilful or negligent` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the violation wilful or negligent?
      `I was a director under whose administration it happened` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were you a director under whose administration it happened?
      `the day it was paid or made` IS A DATE @desc On what day was the unlawful dividend paid, or the unlawful purchase or redemption made (YYYY-MM-DD)?
      `the day the claim is made` IS A DATE @desc On what day is the claim made (YYYY-MM-DD)?
      `I was absent or dissented` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were you absent when it was done, or did you dissent from the act or resolution?
      `my dissent was entered in the minutes at the time or immediately after I had notice` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you cause your dissent to be entered on the books containing the minutes of the directors' proceedings at the time it was done, or immediately after you had notice of it?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Am I liable to the corporation as a director for an unlawful dividend, stock purchase or redemption` IF
    `s 174(a) the director is liable to the corporation` `my position`
    WHERE
        `my position` MEANS `s 174(a) Facts about a director and an unlawful payment` WITH
            `the dividend, purchase or redemption violated section 160 or section 173` IS `it violated section 160 or 173`
            `the violation was wilful or negligent` IS `the violation was wilful or negligent`
            `the director was a director under whose administration it happened` IS `I was a director under whose administration it happened`
            `the day the unlawful dividend was paid or the unlawful purchase or redemption was made` IS `the day it was paid or made`
            `the day the claim is made` IS `the day the claim is made`
            `the director was absent when it was done or dissented from the act or resolution` IS `I was absent or dissented`
            `the director caused the dissent to be entered on the books containing the minutes of the proceedings of the directors at the time it was done or immediately after the director had notice of it` IS `my dissent was entered in the minutes at the time or immediately after I had notice`
            -- Placeholder: the rule for liability to the corporation does not read this field (the creditors' question does).
            `the corporation is dissolved or insolvent` IS FALSE

@export Am I liable to the creditors of the corporation as a director for an unlawful dividend, stock purchase or redemption (s 174(a))?
GIVEN `it violated section 160 or 173` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the dividend, stock purchase or redemption violate section 160 or section 173?
      `the violation was wilful or negligent` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the violation wilful or negligent?
      `I was a director under whose administration it happened` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were you a director under whose administration it happened?
      `the day it was paid or made` IS A DATE @desc On what day was the unlawful dividend paid, or the unlawful purchase or redemption made (YYYY-MM-DD)?
      `the day the claim is made` IS A DATE @desc On what day is the claim made (YYYY-MM-DD)?
      `I was absent or dissented` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were you absent when it was done, or did you dissent from the act or resolution?
      `my dissent was entered in the minutes at the time or immediately after I had notice` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you cause your dissent to be entered on the books containing the minutes of the directors' proceedings at the time it was done, or immediately after you had notice of it?
      `the corporation is dissolved or insolvent` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the corporation dissolved or insolvent?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Am I liable to the creditors of the corporation as a director for an unlawful dividend, stock purchase or redemption` IF
    `s 174(a) the director is liable to the creditors of the corporation` `my position`
    WHERE
        `my position` MEANS `s 174(a) Facts about a director and an unlawful payment` WITH
            `the dividend, purchase or redemption violated section 160 or section 173` IS `it violated section 160 or 173`
            `the violation was wilful or negligent` IS `the violation was wilful or negligent`
            `the director was a director under whose administration it happened` IS `I was a director under whose administration it happened`
            `the day the unlawful dividend was paid or the unlawful purchase or redemption was made` IS `the day it was paid or made`
            `the day the claim is made` IS `the day the claim is made`
            `the director was absent when it was done or dissented from the act or resolution` IS `I was absent or dissented`
            `the director caused the dissent to be entered on the books containing the minutes of the proceedings of the directors at the time it was done or immediately after the director had notice of it` IS `my dissent was entered in the minutes at the time or immediately after I had notice`
            `the corporation is dissolved or insolvent` IS `the corporation is dissolved or insolvent`

@export Am I exonerated from liability as a director because I was absent or dissented (s 174(a))?
GIVEN `I was absent or dissented` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were you absent when it was done, or did you dissent from the act or resolution?
      `my dissent was entered in the minutes at the time or immediately after I had notice` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you cause your dissent to be entered on the books containing the minutes of the directors' proceedings at the time it was done, or immediately after you had notice of it?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Am I exonerated from liability as a director because I was absent or dissented` IF
    `s 174(a) the director is exonerated from the liability` `my position`
    WHERE
        `my position` MEANS `s 174(a) Facts about a director and an unlawful payment` WITH
            -- Placeholders: the exoneration rule does not read these fields.
            `the dividend, purchase or redemption violated section 160 or section 173` IS TRUE
            `the violation was wilful or negligent` IS TRUE
            `the director was a director under whose administration it happened` IS TRUE
            `the day the unlawful dividend was paid or the unlawful purchase or redemption was made` IS YearMonthDay 2000 1 1
            `the day the claim is made` IS YearMonthDay 2000 1 1
            `the corporation is dissolved or insolvent` IS FALSE
            -- What the rule reads:
            `the director was absent when it was done or dissented from the act or resolution` IS `I was absent or dissented`
            `the director caused the dissent to be entered on the books containing the minutes of the proceedings of the directors at the time it was done or immediately after the director had notice of it` IS `my dissent was entered in the minutes at the time or immediately after I had notice`

@export For how much are the directors liable for an unlawful dividend, purchase or redemption (s 174(a))?
GIVEN `the full amount unlawfully paid` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the full amount of the dividend unlawfully paid, or unlawfully paid for the purchase or redemption of the stock, in dollars?
      `the interest from the time the liability accrued` IS A NUMBER @desc How much interest has accrued from the time the liability accrued, in dollars?
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `For how much are the directors liable for an unlawful dividend, purchase or redemption` IS
    `s 174(a) the amount for which the directors are liable` `the full amount unlawfully paid` `the interest from the time the liability accrued`

@export Am I, a director against whom a claim succeeded, entitled to contribution from another director (s 174(b))?
GIVEN `a claim was successfully asserted against me under section 174` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has a claim been successfully asserted against you under section 174?
      `the other director voted for or concurred` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the other director vote for or concur in the unlawful dividend, stock purchase or stock redemption?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Am I entitled to contribution from the other director` IF
    `s 174(b) the other director owes contribution to the director` `a claim was successfully asserted against me under section 174` `the other director voted for or concurred`

@export How much can a director who paid a successful claim recover from me, a stockholder who received the unlawful dividend (s 174(c))?
GIVEN `a claim was successfully asserted against the director under section 174` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has a claim been successfully asserted against the director under section 174?
      `the amount the director paid on the claim` IS A NUMBER @desc How much did the director pay as a result of the claim, in dollars?
      `I received it knowing facts indicating it was unlawful` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you receive the dividend, or assets for the sale or redemption of your stock, with knowledge of facts indicating it was unlawful under the chapter?
      `the amount I received` IS A NUMBER @desc How much did you receive, in dollars?
      `the total received by all stockholders who received it with that knowledge` IS A NUMBER @desc How much did all the stockholders who received it with that knowledge receive in all, in dollars?
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `How much can a director who paid a successful claim recover from me as a stockholder` IS
    `s 174(c) the amount of the corporation's rights against the stockholder to which the director is subrogated` `a claim was successfully asserted against the director under section 174` `the amount the director paid on the claim` `I received it knowing facts indicating it was unlawful` `the amount I received` `the total received by all stockholders who received it with that knowledge`

§ `Sections 201 and 202: stock transfers`

@export Does Article 8 of Title 6 or the General Corporation Law govern the transfer of my stock (s 201)?
GIVEN `the chapter otherwise provides for the matter` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the General Corporation Law otherwise provide for the matter?
      `a provision of the chapter is inconsistent with one in subtitle I of Title 6` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is a provision of the General Corporation Law inconsistent with a provision of subtitle I of Title 6?
GIVETH A `s 201 What governs the transfer of stock`
DECIDE `Which law governs the transfer of my stock` IS
    `s 201 what governs the transfer of the stock` `the chapter otherwise provides for the matter` `a provision of the chapter is inconsistent with one in subtitle I of Title 6`

@export Can this restriction on my securities be enforced against me (s 202(a))?
GIVEN `the restriction is written` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the restriction on the transfer or registration of transfer of the securities, or on the amount that may be owned, written?
      `the restriction is permitted by section 202` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the restriction permitted by section 202?
      `my securities are represented by a certificate` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the restricted securities represented by a certificate (rather than uncertificated)?
      `the restriction is noted conspicuously on the certificate` IS A BOOLEAN @desc If so, is the restriction noted conspicuously on the certificate?
      `the restriction is in the notice given under section 151(f)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc If the shares are uncertificated: is the restriction contained in the notice given under section 151(f)?
      `I have actual knowledge of the restriction` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you have actual knowledge of the restriction?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Can this restriction on my securities be enforced against me` IF
    `s 202(a) the restriction may be enforced against the person` `the restriction and I`
    WHERE
        `the restriction and I` MEANS `s 202(a) Facts about a restriction and the person it is asserted against` WITH
            `the restriction is written` IS `the restriction is written`
            `the restriction is permitted by section 202` IS `the restriction is permitted by section 202`
            `the restricted securities are represented by a certificate` IS `my securities are represented by a certificate`
            `the restriction is noted conspicuously on the certificate` IS `the restriction is noted conspicuously on the certificate`
            `the restriction is contained in the notice given pursuant to section 151(f)` IS `the restriction is in the notice given under section 151(f)`
            `the person has actual knowledge of the restriction` IS `I have actual knowledge of the restriction`

@export May a restriction on my securities be imposed in this way (s 202(b))?
GIVEN `how the restriction is imposed` IS A `s 202(b) How a restriction is imposed` @desc How is the restriction imposed? One of: by the certificate of incorporation under s 202(b); by the bylaws under s 202(b); by an agreement among any number of security holders under s 202(b); by an agreement among such holders and the corporation under s 202(b); in another way under s 202(b).
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May a restriction on my securities be imposed in this way` IS
    `s 202(b) the restriction may be imposed in that way` `how the restriction is imposed`

@export Is a restriction adopted after I got my securities binding on me (s 202(b))?
GIVEN `my securities were issued before the restriction was adopted` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were your securities issued before the restriction was adopted?
      `I am a party to an agreement about the restriction` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a party to an agreement about the restriction?
      `I voted in favor of the restriction` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you vote in favor of the restriction?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is a restriction adopted after I got my securities binding on me` IS
    `s 202(b) the restriction is binding with respect to the securities` `my securities were issued before the restriction was adopted` `I am a party to an agreement about the restriction` `I voted in favor of the restriction`

@export Is this restriction on transfer or ownership permitted by section 202 (s 202(c), (e))?
GIVEN `it obliges the holder to offer a prior opportunity to acquire` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it obligate the holder to offer the corporation, other holders or any other person (or a combination) a prior opportunity to acquire the restricted securities?
      `that opportunity is exercisable within a reasonable time` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is that opportunity to be exercised within a reasonable time?
      `it obliges someone to buy the securities under an agreement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it obligate the corporation, a holder or any other person (or a combination) to purchase the securities that are the subject of an agreement respecting their purchase and sale?
      `it requires consent to a transfer, approval of the transferee or approval of the amount owned` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it require the corporation or the holders of a class or series to consent to a proposed transfer, to approve the proposed transferee, or to approve the amount of securities that may be owned?
      `it obliges the holder to sell, or causes an automatic sale` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it obligate the holder to sell or transfer an amount of the restricted securities, or cause their automatic sale or transfer?
      `it bars transfer to or ownership by designated persons` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it prohibit or restrict the transfer to, or the ownership by, designated persons or classes of persons or groups?
      `the designation is manifestly unreasonable` IS A BOOLEAN @desc If so, is the designation manifestly unreasonable?
      `the restriction is otherwise lawful` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the restriction otherwise lawful?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is this restriction on transfer or ownership permitted by section 202` IF
    `s 202(e) the restriction is permitted by section 202` (`s 202(c) the restriction is of a kind that section 202 permits` `the kind of restriction`) `the restriction is otherwise lawful`
    WHERE
        `the kind of restriction` MEANS `s 202(c) The kind of restriction` WITH
            `it obligates the holder to offer to the corporation, other holders or any other person, or any combination, a prior opportunity to acquire the restricted securities` IS `it obliges the holder to offer a prior opportunity to acquire`
            `that opportunity is to be exercised within a reasonable time` IS `that opportunity is exercisable within a reasonable time`
            `it obligates the corporation, a holder or any other person, or any combination, to purchase the securities that are the subject of an agreement respecting their purchase and sale` IS `it obliges someone to buy the securities under an agreement`
            `it requires the corporation or the holders of any class or series to consent to a proposed transfer, to approve the proposed transferee, or to approve the amount of securities that may be owned` IS `it requires consent to a transfer, approval of the transferee or approval of the amount owned`
            `it obligates the holder to sell or transfer an amount of the restricted securities, or causes or results in their automatic sale or transfer` IS `it obliges the holder to sell, or causes an automatic sale`
            `it prohibits or restricts the transfer to, or the ownership by, designated persons or classes of persons or groups of persons` IS `it bars transfer to or ownership by designated persons`
            `the designation is manifestly unreasonable` IS `the designation is manifestly unreasonable`

@export Is the purpose of this restriction conclusively presumed to be reasonable (s 202(d))?
GIVEN `it maintains a tax advantage to the corporation or its stockholders` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it to maintain a local, state, federal or foreign tax advantage to the corporation or its stockholders?
      `it maintains subchapter S status` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it to maintain the corporation's status as an electing small business corporation under subchapter S of the Internal Revenue Code?
      `it preserves a tax attribute` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it to maintain or preserve a tax attribute, including net operating losses?
      `it keeps real estate investment trust status` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it to qualify or maintain the qualification of the corporation as a real estate investment trust?
      `it keeps a statutory or regulatory advantage or complies with a requirement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it to maintain a statutory or regulatory advantage, or to comply with a statutory or regulatory requirement, under applicable local, state, federal or foreign law?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is the purpose of this restriction conclusively presumed to be reasonable` IS
    `s 202(d) the restriction is conclusively presumed to be for a reasonable purpose` `its purposes`
    WHERE
        `its purposes` MEANS `s 202(d) The purpose of a restriction` WITH
            `maintaining a local, state, federal or foreign tax advantage to the corporation or its stockholders` IS `it maintains a tax advantage to the corporation or its stockholders`
            `maintaining the corporation's status as an electing small business corporation under subchapter S of the United States Internal Revenue Code` IS `it maintains subchapter S status`
            `maintaining or preserving a tax attribute, including net operating losses` IS `it preserves a tax attribute`
            `qualifying or maintaining the qualification of the corporation as a real estate investment trust under the United States Internal Revenue Code` IS `it keeps real estate investment trust status`
            `maintaining a statutory or regulatory advantage or complying with a statutory or regulatory requirement under applicable local, state, federal or foreign law` IS `it keeps a statutory or regulatory advantage or complies with a requirement`


§ `Section 203(a): the 3-year bar on business combinations with an interested stockholder`

-- The kind of transaction that may be proposed under section 203(b)(6): the person states which it is, and the facts that kind needs.
DECLARE `dg3 seat The kind of transaction proposed` IS ONE OF
    `a merger or consolidation of the corporation, as proposed`
    `a sale or other disposition of assets, as proposed`
    `a tender or exchange offer, as proposed`
    `another transaction, as proposed`

@export Did the board approve the business combination, or the transaction that made me an interested stockholder, before I became one (s 203(a)(1))?
GIVEN `the board approved the business combination before that time` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Before the time you became an interested stockholder, did the corporation's board of directors approve the business combination?
      `the board approved the transaction that made me an interested stockholder` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Before that time, did the board approve the transaction which resulted in you becoming an interested stockholder?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Did the board approve the business combination or the transaction before I became an interested stockholder` IF
    `s 203(a)(1) the board of directors approved before that time` `our facts`
    WHERE
        `our facts` MEANS `s 203(a) Facts about a business combination with an interested stockholder` WITH
            `prior to such time the board of directors approved the business combination` IS `the board approved the business combination before that time`
            `prior to such time the board of directors approved the transaction which resulted in the stockholder becoming an interested stockholder` IS `the board approved the transaction that made me an interested stockholder`
            -- Placeholders: the (a)(1) rule does not read the other fields.
            `the day the stockholder became an interested stockholder` IS YearMonthDay 2000 1 1
            `the day of the business combination` IS YearMonthDay 2000 1 1
            `the votes of the voting stock that the interested stockholder owned upon consummation of the transaction` IS 0
            `the votes of the voting stock of the corporation outstanding at the time the transaction commenced` IS 0
            `the votes of the outstanding stock owned by persons who are directors and also officers` IS 0
            `of those votes, the votes owned by the interested stockholder (directors and officers)` IS 0
            `the votes of the outstanding stock owned by employee stock plans in which employee participants do not have the right to determine confidentially whether shares held subject to the plan will be tendered in a tender or exchange offer` IS 0
            `of those votes, the votes owned by the interested stockholder (employee stock plans)` IS 0
            `at or subsequent to such time the business combination is approved by the board of directors` IS FALSE
            `the business combination is authorized at an annual or special meeting of stockholders` IS FALSE
            `the business combination is authorized by written consent` IS FALSE
            `the votes in favor of the business combination (the affirmative vote) of the outstanding voting stock which is not owned by the interested stockholder` IS 0
            `the votes of the outstanding voting stock which is not owned by the interested stockholder` IS 0

@export Did I own at least 85% of the voting stock outstanding when the transaction that made me an interested stockholder commenced (s 203(a)(2))?
GIVEN `the votes I owned upon consummation of the transaction` IS A NUMBER @desc Upon consummation of the transaction which made you an interested stockholder, how many votes of the corporation's voting stock did you own?
      `the votes outstanding when the transaction commenced` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes did the corporation's voting stock carry in all, outstanding at the time the transaction commenced?
      `the votes of stock owned by directors who are also officers` IS A NUMBER @desc How many of those votes were stock owned by persons who are directors and also officers?
      `of those, the votes I own` IS A NUMBER @desc Of those, how many votes do you yourself own?
      `the votes of stock in employee plans without a confidential tender decision` IS A NUMBER @desc How many of those votes were stock held in employee stock plans in which participants do not have the right to determine confidentially whether shares held subject to the plan will be tendered?
      `of those plan votes, the votes I own` IS A NUMBER @desc Of those, how many votes do you yourself own?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Did I own at least 85% of the voting stock outstanding when the transaction commenced` IS
    `s 203(a)(2) the interested stockholder owned at least 85% of the voting stock outstanding` `our facts`
    WHERE
        `our facts` MEANS `s 203(a) Facts about a business combination with an interested stockholder` WITH
            `the votes of the voting stock that the interested stockholder owned upon consummation of the transaction` IS `the votes I owned upon consummation of the transaction`
            `the votes of the voting stock of the corporation outstanding at the time the transaction commenced` IS `the votes outstanding when the transaction commenced`
            `the votes of the outstanding stock owned by persons who are directors and also officers` IS `the votes of stock owned by directors who are also officers`
            `of those votes, the votes owned by the interested stockholder (directors and officers)` IS `of those, the votes I own`
            `the votes of the outstanding stock owned by employee stock plans in which employee participants do not have the right to determine confidentially whether shares held subject to the plan will be tendered in a tender or exchange offer` IS `the votes of stock in employee plans without a confidential tender decision`
            `of those votes, the votes owned by the interested stockholder (employee stock plans)` IS `of those plan votes, the votes I own`
            -- Placeholders: the (a)(2) rule does not read the other fields.
            `the day the stockholder became an interested stockholder` IS YearMonthDay 2000 1 1
            `the day of the business combination` IS YearMonthDay 2000 1 1
            `prior to such time the board of directors approved the business combination` IS FALSE
            `prior to such time the board of directors approved the transaction which resulted in the stockholder becoming an interested stockholder` IS FALSE
            `at or subsequent to such time the business combination is approved by the board of directors` IS FALSE
            `the business combination is authorized at an annual or special meeting of stockholders` IS FALSE
            `the business combination is authorized by written consent` IS FALSE
            `the votes in favor of the business combination (the affirmative vote) of the outstanding voting stock which is not owned by the interested stockholder` IS 0
            `the votes of the outstanding voting stock which is not owned by the interested stockholder` IS 0

@export Was the business combination approved and authorized by the vote the Law requires (s 203(a)(3))?
GIVEN `the board approved the business combination at or after that time` IS A BOOLEAN @desc At or subsequent to the time you became an interested stockholder, did the board of directors approve the business combination?
      `it was authorized at an annual or special meeting` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was it authorized at an annual or special meeting of stockholders?
      `it was authorized by written consent` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was it authorized by written consent?
      `the votes in favor` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes were cast in favor, of the outstanding voting stock which is not owned by you?
      `the votes of the outstanding voting stock not owned by me` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes does the outstanding voting stock which you do not own carry in all?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Was the business combination approved and authorized by the vote the Law requires` IS
    `s 203(a)(3) the business combination was approved and authorized by the required vote` `our facts`
    WHERE
        `our facts` MEANS `s 203(a) Facts about a business combination with an interested stockholder` WITH
            `at or subsequent to such time the business combination is approved by the board of directors` IS `the board approved the business combination at or after that time`
            `the business combination is authorized at an annual or special meeting of stockholders` IS `it was authorized at an annual or special meeting`
            `the business combination is authorized by written consent` IS `it was authorized by written consent`
            `the votes in favor of the business combination (the affirmative vote) of the outstanding voting stock which is not owned by the interested stockholder` IS `the votes in favor`
            `the votes of the outstanding voting stock which is not owned by the interested stockholder` IS `the votes of the outstanding voting stock not owned by me`
            -- Placeholders: the (a)(3) rule does not read the other fields.
            `the day the stockholder became an interested stockholder` IS YearMonthDay 2000 1 1
            `the day of the business combination` IS YearMonthDay 2000 1 1
            `prior to such time the board of directors approved the business combination` IS FALSE
            `prior to such time the board of directors approved the transaction which resulted in the stockholder becoming an interested stockholder` IS FALSE
            `the votes of the voting stock that the interested stockholder owned upon consummation of the transaction` IS 0
            `the votes of the voting stock of the corporation outstanding at the time the transaction commenced` IS 0
            `the votes of the outstanding stock owned by persons who are directors and also officers` IS 0
            `of those votes, the votes owned by the interested stockholder (directors and officers)` IS 0
            `the votes of the outstanding stock owned by employee stock plans in which employee participants do not have the right to determine confidentially whether shares held subject to the plan will be tendered in a tender or exchange offer` IS 0
            `of those votes, the votes owned by the interested stockholder (employee stock plans)` IS 0

@export Is our corporation barred from engaging in a business combination with me for 3 years after I became an interested stockholder (s 203(a))?
GIVEN `the day I became an interested stockholder` IS A DATE @desc On what day did you become an interested stockholder (YYYY-MM-DD)?
      `the day of the business combination` IS A DATE @desc On what day is the business combination (YYYY-MM-DD)?
      `the board approved the business combination before that time` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Before the time you became an interested stockholder, did the corporation's board of directors approve the business combination?
      `the board approved the transaction that made me an interested stockholder` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Before that time, did the board approve the transaction which resulted in you becoming an interested stockholder?
      `the votes I owned upon consummation of the transaction` IS A NUMBER @desc Upon consummation of the transaction which made you an interested stockholder, how many votes of the corporation's voting stock did you own?
      `the votes outstanding when the transaction commenced` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes did the corporation's voting stock carry in all, outstanding at the time the transaction commenced?
      `the votes of stock owned by directors who are also officers` IS A NUMBER @desc How many of those votes were stock owned by persons who are directors and also officers?
      `of those, the votes I own` IS A NUMBER @desc Of those, how many votes do you yourself own?
      `the votes of stock in employee plans without a confidential tender decision` IS A NUMBER @desc How many of those votes were stock held in employee stock plans in which participants do not have the right to determine confidentially whether shares held subject to the plan will be tendered?
      `of those plan votes, the votes I own` IS A NUMBER @desc Of those, how many votes do you yourself own?
      `the board approved the business combination at or after that time` IS A BOOLEAN @desc At or subsequent to the time you became an interested stockholder, did the board of directors approve the business combination?
      `it was authorized at an annual or special meeting` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was it authorized at an annual or special meeting of stockholders?
      `it was authorized by written consent` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was it authorized by written consent?
      `the votes in favor` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes were cast in favor, of the outstanding voting stock which is not owned by you?
      `the votes of the outstanding voting stock not owned by me` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes does the outstanding voting stock which you do not own carry in all?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is our corporation barred from engaging in a business combination with me for 3 years after I became an interested stockholder` IS
    `s 203(a) the corporation is barred from engaging in the business combination` `our facts`
    WHERE
        `our facts` MEANS `s 203(a) Facts about a business combination with an interested stockholder` WITH
            `the day the stockholder became an interested stockholder` IS `the day I became an interested stockholder`
            `the day of the business combination` IS `the day of the business combination`
            `prior to such time the board of directors approved the business combination` IS `the board approved the business combination before that time`
            `prior to such time the board of directors approved the transaction which resulted in the stockholder becoming an interested stockholder` IS `the board approved the transaction that made me an interested stockholder`
            `the votes of the voting stock that the interested stockholder owned upon consummation of the transaction` IS `the votes I owned upon consummation of the transaction`
            `the votes of the voting stock of the corporation outstanding at the time the transaction commenced` IS `the votes outstanding when the transaction commenced`
            `the votes of the outstanding stock owned by persons who are directors and also officers` IS `the votes of stock owned by directors who are also officers`
            `of those votes, the votes owned by the interested stockholder (directors and officers)` IS `of those, the votes I own`
            `the votes of the outstanding stock owned by employee stock plans in which employee participants do not have the right to determine confidentially whether shares held subject to the plan will be tendered in a tender or exchange offer` IS `the votes of stock in employee plans without a confidential tender decision`
            `of those votes, the votes owned by the interested stockholder (employee stock plans)` IS `of those plan votes, the votes I own`
            `at or subsequent to such time the business combination is approved by the board of directors` IS `the board approved the business combination at or after that time`
            `the business combination is authorized at an annual or special meeting of stockholders` IS `it was authorized at an annual or special meeting`
            `the business combination is authorized by written consent` IS `it was authorized by written consent`
            `the votes in favor of the business combination (the affirmative vote) of the outstanding voting stock which is not owned by the interested stockholder` IS `the votes in favor`
            `the votes of the outstanding voting stock which is not owned by the interested stockholder` IS `the votes of the outstanding voting stock not owned by me`

§ `Section 203(b): when the restrictions do not apply`

@export Did our original certificate of incorporation elect not to be governed by section 203 (s 203(b)(1))?
GIVEN `our original certificate contains such a provision` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the corporation's original certificate of incorporation contain a provision expressly electing not to be governed by section 203?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Did our original certificate of incorporation elect not to be governed by section 203` IF
    `s 203(b)(1) the restrictions do not apply because the original certificate elects out` `our original certificate contains such a provision`

@export Did our board elect out of section 203 by a bylaw amendment within 90 days of 2 February 1988 (s 203(b)(2))?
GIVEN `our board adopted such an amendment` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the board of directors adopt an amendment to the bylaws expressly electing not to be governed by section 203?
      `the day our board adopted it` IS A DATE @desc If so, on what day (YYYY-MM-DD; any date if not)?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Did our board elect out of section 203 by a bylaw amendment within 90 days of 2 February 1988` IF
    `s 203(b)(2) the restrictions do not apply because the board adopted a bylaw election in 1988` (IF `our board adopted such an amendment` THEN JUST `the day our board adopted it` ELSE NOTHING)

@export May our board further amend that bylaw amendment (s 203(b)(2))?
GIVEN `it is a bylaw amendment the board adopted under section 203(b)(2)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it a bylaw amendment adopted by the board of directors pursuant to section 203(b)(2)?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is our board barred from further amending the bylaw amendment adopted under section 203(b)(2)` IF
    `s 203(b)(2) the board of directors is barred from further amending the bylaw amendment` `it is a bylaw amendment the board adopted under section 203(b)(2)`

@export Did our stockholders adopt, by the vote the Law requires, an amendment electing not to be governed by section 203 (s 203(b)(3))?
GIVEN `the instrument the stockholders amended` IS A `s 203(b)(3) Which instrument the stockholders amended` @desc Which instrument did the stockholders amend? One of: the certificate of incorporation under s 203(b)(3); the bylaws under s 203(b)(3).
      `the votes in favor of the amendment` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes were cast in favor of the amendment?
      `the outstanding stock entitled to vote, in votes` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes does the outstanding stock entitled to vote carry in all?
      `another law requires a greater vote` IS A BOOLEAN @desc In addition to the majority, does any other law require a greater vote?
      `the percentage another law requires` IS A NUMBER @desc If so, what percentage of the outstanding stock entitled to vote (0 to 100; 0 if none)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Did our stockholders adopt the amendment by the vote the Law requires` IS
    `s 203(b)(3) the stockholders adopted the amendment by the required vote` `our election`
    WHERE
        `our election` MEANS `s 203(b)(3) Facts about an election by the stockholders` WITH
            `the instrument amended` IS `the instrument the stockholders amended`
            `the votes in favor of the amendment` IS `the votes in favor of the amendment`
            `the outstanding stock entitled to vote thereon, in votes` IS `the outstanding stock entitled to vote, in votes`
            `the greater vote required by any other law, if any` IS
                IF `another law requires a greater vote`
                THEN JUST (`at least` ((`the percentage another law requires`) DIVIDED BY 100) `of` `the outstanding stock entitled to vote`)
                ELSE NOTHING
            -- Placeholders: the vote rule does not read the other fields.
            `the corporation has never had a class of voting stock that falls within either of the 2 categories set out in paragraph (b)(4)` IS FALSE
            `the corporation has not elected by a provision in its original certificate of incorporation or any amendment to be governed by section 203` IS FALSE
            `the day the amendment takes effect under section 103 (certificate) or the day it was adopted (bylaws)` IS YearMonthDay 2000 1 1

@export From what day does our stockholders' election not to be governed by section 203 take effect (s 203(b)(3))?
GIVEN `we have never had a listed or widely held class of voting stock` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the corporation never had a class of voting stock that is listed on a national securities exchange or held of record by more than 2,000 stockholders?
      `we have not elected to be governed by section 203` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the corporation not elected, by a provision in its original certificate or any amendment, to be governed by section 203?
      `the day of the amendment` IS A DATE @desc For a certificate amendment, the day it takes effect under section 103; for a bylaw amendment, the day it was adopted (YYYY-MM-DD).
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `From what day does our stockholders' election not to be governed by section 203 take effect` IS
    `s 203(b)(3) the day from which the election not to be governed takes effect` `our election`
    WHERE
        `our election` MEANS `s 203(b)(3) Facts about an election by the stockholders` WITH
            `the corporation has never had a class of voting stock that falls within either of the 2 categories set out in paragraph (b)(4)` IS `we have never had a listed or widely held class of voting stock`
            `the corporation has not elected by a provision in its original certificate of incorporation or any amendment to be governed by section 203` IS `we have not elected to be governed by section 203`
            `the day the amendment takes effect under section 103 (certificate) or the day it was adopted (bylaws)` IS `the day of the amendment`
            -- Placeholders: the rule does not read the other fields.
            `the instrument amended` IS `the bylaws under s 203(b)(3)`
            `the votes in favor of the amendment` IS 0
            `the outstanding stock entitled to vote thereon, in votes` IS 0
            `the greater vote required by any other law, if any` IS NOTHING

@export Does our stockholders' election not to be governed by section 203 free the corporation from the restrictions in this business combination (s 203(b)(3))?
GIVEN `the instrument the stockholders amended` IS A `s 203(b)(3) Which instrument the stockholders amended` @desc Which instrument did the stockholders amend? One of: the certificate of incorporation under s 203(b)(3); the bylaws under s 203(b)(3).
      `the votes in favor of the amendment` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes were cast in favor of the amendment?
      `the outstanding stock entitled to vote, in votes` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes does the outstanding stock entitled to vote carry in all?
      `another law requires a greater vote` IS A BOOLEAN @desc In addition to the majority, does any other law require a greater vote?
      `the percentage another law requires` IS A NUMBER @desc If so, what percentage of the outstanding stock entitled to vote (0 to 100; 0 if none)?
      `we have never had a listed or widely held class of voting stock` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the corporation never had a class of voting stock that is listed on a national securities exchange or held of record by more than 2,000 stockholders?
      `we have not elected to be governed by section 203` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the corporation not elected, by a provision in its original certificate or any amendment, to be governed by section 203?
      `the day of the amendment` IS A DATE @desc For a certificate amendment, the day it takes effect under section 103; for a bylaw amendment, the day it was adopted (YYYY-MM-DD).
      `the day of the business combination` IS A DATE @desc On what day is the business combination (YYYY-MM-DD)?
      `the day I became an interested stockholder` IS A DATE @desc On what day did the stockholder become an interested stockholder (YYYY-MM-DD)?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Does our stockholders' election not to be governed by section 203 free the corporation from the restrictions in this business combination` IF
    `s 203(b)(3) the restrictions do not apply because of the stockholders' election` `our election` `the day of the business combination` `the day I became an interested stockholder`
    WHERE
        `our election` MEANS `s 203(b)(3) Facts about an election by the stockholders` WITH
            `the instrument amended` IS `the instrument the stockholders amended`
            `the votes in favor of the amendment` IS `the votes in favor of the amendment`
            `the outstanding stock entitled to vote thereon, in votes` IS `the outstanding stock entitled to vote, in votes`
            `the greater vote required by any other law, if any` IS
                IF `another law requires a greater vote`
                THEN JUST (`at least` ((`the percentage another law requires`) DIVIDED BY 100) `of` `the outstanding stock entitled to vote`)
                ELSE NOTHING
            `the corporation has never had a class of voting stock that falls within either of the 2 categories set out in paragraph (b)(4)` IS `we have never had a listed or widely held class of voting stock`
            `the corporation has not elected by a provision in its original certificate of incorporation or any amendment to be governed by section 203` IS `we have not elected to be governed by section 203`
            `the day the amendment takes effect under section 103 (certificate) or the day it was adopted (bylaws)` IS `the day of the amendment`

@export May our board further amend a bylaw amendment our stockholders adopted under section 203(b)(3) (s 203(b)(3))?
GIVEN `it is a bylaw amendment the stockholders adopted under section 203(b)(3)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it a bylaw amendment adopted by the stockholders pursuant to section 203(b)(3)?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is our board barred from further amending a bylaw amendment our stockholders adopted under section 203(b)(3)` IF
    `s 203(b)(3) the board of directors is barred from further amending the bylaw amendment` `it is a bylaw amendment the stockholders adopted under section 203(b)(3)`

@export Is our corporation outside section 203 because it has no listed or widely held class of voting stock (s 203(b)(4))?
GIVEN `a class of our voting stock is listed on a national securities exchange` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is a class of the corporation's voting stock listed on a national securities exchange?
      `that listing results from an interested stockholder's action or a transaction in which a person becomes one` IS A BOOLEAN @desc If so, does the listing result from action taken, directly or indirectly, by an interested stockholder or from a transaction in which a person becomes an interested stockholder?
      `the most holders of record of any class of our voting stock` IS A NUMBER @desc How many stockholders of record hold the class of voting stock that has the most holders?
      `that number results from an interested stockholder's action or a transaction in which a person becomes one` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does that number result from action taken, directly or indirectly, by an interested stockholder or from a transaction in which a person becomes an interested stockholder?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is our corporation outside section 203 because it has no listed or widely held class of voting stock` IF
    `s 203(b)(4) the restrictions do not apply because the corporation has no listed or widely held class of voting stock` `our classes`
    WHERE
        `our classes` MEANS `s 203(b)(4) Facts about the classes of voting stock` WITH
            `a class of voting stock is listed on a national securities exchange` IS `a class of our voting stock is listed on a national securities exchange`
            `that listing results from action taken, directly or indirectly, by an interested stockholder or from a transaction in which a person becomes an interested stockholder` IS `that listing results from an interested stockholder's action or a transaction in which a person becomes one`
            `the number of stockholders of record of the class of voting stock with the most holders` IS `the most holders of record of any class of our voting stock`
            `that number results from action taken, directly or indirectly, by an interested stockholder or from a transaction in which a person becomes an interested stockholder` IS `that number results from an interested stockholder's action or a transaction in which a person becomes one`

@export Do the restrictions in section 203 not apply because I became an interested stockholder inadvertently (s 203(b)(5))?
GIVEN `I became an interested stockholder inadvertently` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you become an interested stockholder inadvertently?
      `I divested myself of enough shares as soon as practicable` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you, as soon as practicable, divest yourself of ownership of sufficient shares so that you ceased to be an interested stockholder?
      `I would not have been an interested stockholder in the previous 3 years but for the inadvertent acquisition` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would you not, at any time within the 3-year period immediately before the business combination, have been an interested stockholder but for the inadvertent acquisition of ownership?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Do the restrictions in section 203 not apply because I became an interested stockholder inadvertently` IF
    `s 203(b)(5) the restrictions do not apply because the stockholder became an interested stockholder inadvertently` `I became an interested stockholder inadvertently` `I divested myself of enough shares as soon as practicable` `I would not have been an interested stockholder in the previous 3 years but for the inadvertent acquisition`

-- Section 203(b)(6): the proposal of the business combination before the consummation or abandonment of a listed transaction, with a person of the described kind, approved or not opposed by the continuing directors.
@export Do the restrictions in section 203 not apply because the business combination is proposed with a transaction the Law lists (s 203(b)(6))?
GIVEN `the kind of transaction proposed` IS A `dg3 seat The kind of transaction proposed` @desc Which kind of transaction is proposed? One of: a merger or consolidation of the corporation, as proposed; a sale or other disposition of assets, as proposed; a tender or exchange offer, as proposed; another transaction, as proposed.
      `no stockholder vote is required for the merger under section 251(f)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc (Merger) Is no vote of the corporation's stockholders required, pursuant to section 251(f)?
      `the disposition is to a wholly-owned subsidiary or to the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc (Assets) Is the disposition to a direct or indirect wholly-owned subsidiary or to the corporation?
      `the market value of the assets` IS A NUMBER @desc (Assets) What is the aggregate market value of the assets disposed of, in dollars?
      `the market value of all the corporation's assets, consolidated` IS A NUMBER @desc (Assets) What is the aggregate market value of all the assets of the corporation determined on a consolidated basis, in dollars?
      `the market value of all the outstanding stock` IS A NUMBER @desc (Assets) What is the aggregate market value of all the outstanding stock of the corporation, in dollars?
      `the votes of voting stock the offer is for` IS A NUMBER @desc (Offer) How many votes of the corporation's outstanding voting stock is the offer for?
      `the votes of the outstanding voting stock` IS A NUMBER @desc (Offer) How many votes does the corporation's outstanding voting stock carry in all?
      `the day the business combination is proposed` IS A DATE @desc On what day is the business combination proposed (YYYY-MM-DD)?
      `the transaction was publicly announced` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the proposed transaction been publicly announced?
      `the day it was announced` IS A DATE @desc If so, on what day (YYYY-MM-DD; any date if not)?
      `notice of the transaction was given` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the notice required by section 203 of the proposed transaction been given?
      `the day the notice was given` IS A DATE @desc If so, on what day (YYYY-MM-DD; any date if not)?
      `the transaction was consummated or abandoned` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the proposed transaction been consummated or abandoned?
      `the day it was consummated or abandoned` IS A DATE @desc If so, on what day (YYYY-MM-DD; any date if not)?
      `the person was not an interested stockholder in the previous 3 years` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the person with or by whom the transaction is proposed not an interested stockholder during the previous 3 years?
      `the person became one with the board's approval` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did that person become an interested stockholder with the approval of the corporation's board of directors?
      `the person became one during the period described in paragraph (b)(7)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did that person become an interested stockholder during the period described in section 203(b)(7)?
      `the continuing directors in office` IS A NUMBER @desc How many members of the board then in office were directors before any person became an interested stockholder in the previous 3 years, or were recommended for election or elected to succeed such directors by a majority of them?
      `how many of them approved or did not oppose` IS A NUMBER @desc How many of those members approved or did not oppose the proposed transaction?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Do the restrictions in section 203 not apply because of the proposal of the business combination` IS
    `s 203(b)(6) the restrictions do not apply because of the proposal of the business combination` `the transaction` `the proposal`
    WHERE
        `the transaction` MEANS
            CONSIDER `the kind of transaction proposed`
            WHEN `a merger or consolidation of the corporation, as proposed` THEN `a merger or consolidation of the corporation under s 203(b)(6)(x)` OF `no stockholder vote is required for the merger under section 251(f)`
            WHEN `a sale or other disposition of assets, as proposed` THEN `a disposition of assets under s 203(b)(6)(y)` OF TRUE, `the disposition is to a wholly-owned subsidiary or to the corporation`, `the market value of the assets`, `the market value of all the corporation's assets, consolidated`, `the market value of all the outstanding stock`
            WHEN `a tender or exchange offer, as proposed` THEN `a tender or exchange offer under s 203(b)(6)(z)` OF `the votes of voting stock the offer is for`, `the votes of the outstanding voting stock`
            WHEN `another transaction, as proposed` THEN `another transaction under s 203(b)(6)`
        `the proposal` MEANS `s 203(b)(6) Facts about the proposal and the person` WITH
            `the day the business combination is proposed` IS `the day the business combination is proposed`
            `the day of the public announcement of the proposed transaction, if any` IS IF `the transaction was publicly announced` THEN JUST `the day it was announced` ELSE NOTHING
            `the day of the notice required hereunder of the proposed transaction, if any` IS IF `notice of the transaction was given` THEN JUST `the day the notice was given` ELSE NOTHING
            `the day the proposed transaction is consummated or abandoned, if it has been` IS IF `the transaction was consummated or abandoned` THEN JUST `the day it was consummated or abandoned` ELSE NOTHING
            `the person was not an interested stockholder during the previous 3 years` IS `the person was not an interested stockholder in the previous 3 years`
            `the person became an interested stockholder with the approval of the corporation's board of directors` IS `the person became one with the board's approval`
            `the person became an interested stockholder during the period described in paragraph (b)(7)` IS `the person became one during the period described in paragraph (b)(7)`
            `the number of members of the board then in office who were directors prior to any person becoming an interested stockholder during the previous 3 years or were recommended for election or elected to succeed such directors by a majority of such directors` IS `the continuing directors in office`
            `the number of those members who approved or did not oppose the proposed transaction` IS `how many of them approved or did not oppose`

@export Must the corporation give all interested stockholders notice of this proposed transaction (s 203(b)(6))?
GIVEN `the kind of transaction proposed` IS A `dg3 seat The kind of transaction proposed` @desc Which kind of transaction is proposed? One of: a merger or consolidation of the corporation, as proposed; a sale or other disposition of assets, as proposed; a tender or exchange offer, as proposed; another transaction, as proposed.
      `no stockholder vote is required for the merger under section 251(f)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc (Merger) Is no vote of the corporation's stockholders required, pursuant to section 251(f)?
      `the disposition is to a wholly-owned subsidiary or to the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc (Assets) Is the disposition to a direct or indirect wholly-owned subsidiary or to the corporation?
      `the market value of the assets` IS A NUMBER @desc (Assets) What is the aggregate market value of the assets disposed of, in dollars?
      `the market value of all the corporation's assets, consolidated` IS A NUMBER @desc (Assets) What is the aggregate market value of all the assets of the corporation determined on a consolidated basis, in dollars?
      `the market value of all the outstanding stock` IS A NUMBER @desc (Assets) What is the aggregate market value of all the outstanding stock of the corporation, in dollars?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Must the corporation give all interested stockholders notice of this proposed transaction` IF
    `s 203(b)(6) the corporation must give notice to all interested stockholders` `the transaction`
    WHERE
        `the transaction` MEANS
            CONSIDER `the kind of transaction proposed`
            WHEN `a merger or consolidation of the corporation, as proposed` THEN `a merger or consolidation of the corporation under s 203(b)(6)(x)` OF `no stockholder vote is required for the merger under section 251(f)`
            WHEN `a sale or other disposition of assets, as proposed` THEN `a disposition of assets under s 203(b)(6)(y)` OF TRUE, `the disposition is to a wholly-owned subsidiary or to the corporation`, `the market value of the assets`, `the market value of all the corporation's assets, consolidated`, `the market value of all the outstanding stock`
            -- Placeholders: the notice rule does not read the figures of an offer.
            WHEN `a tender or exchange offer, as proposed` THEN `a tender or exchange offer under s 203(b)(6)(z)` OF 0, 1
            WHEN `another transaction, as proposed` THEN `another transaction under s 203(b)(6)`

@export Was the notice given to the interested stockholders at least 20 days before the transaction was consummated (s 203(b)(6))?
GIVEN `the day the notice was given to the interested stockholders` IS A DATE @desc On what day was the notice given to all interested stockholders (YYYY-MM-DD)?
      `the day the transaction is consummated` IS A DATE @desc On what day is the transaction consummated (YYYY-MM-DD)?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Was the notice given to the interested stockholders at least 20 days before the transaction was consummated` IF
    `s 203(b)(6) the notice to the interested stockholders is timely` `the day the notice was given to the interested stockholders` `the day the transaction is consummated`

@export Do the restrictions in section 203 not apply because I became an interested stockholder when they did not apply (s 203(b)(7))?
GIVEN `the restrictions did not apply when I became an interested stockholder, by reason of paragraph (b)(1) to (4)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc When you became an interested stockholder, did the restrictions in section 203 not apply by reason of any of paragraphs (b)(1) through (4)?
      `our certificate then contained a provision electing to be governed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc At that time, did the corporation's certificate of incorporation contain a provision authorized by the last sentence of section 203(b) (electing to be governed by section 203)?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Do the restrictions in section 203 not apply because I became an interested stockholder when they did not apply` IF
    `s 203(b)(7) the restrictions do not apply because the stockholder became an interested stockholder when they did not apply` `the restrictions did not apply when I became an interested stockholder, by reason of paragraph (b)(1) to (4)` `our certificate then contained a provision electing to be governed`

@export Does our corporation's election to be governed by section 203 apply to me as an interested stockholder (s 203(b), last paragraph)?
GIVEN `our original certificate elected to be governed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the corporation elect, by a provision of its original certificate of incorporation, to be governed by section 203?
      `an amendment to our certificate elected to be governed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the corporation elect, by an amendment to its certificate of incorporation, to be governed by section 203?
      `the amendment became effective on a day` IS A BOOLEAN @desc If by amendment: do you know the day it became effective under section 103?
      `the day the amendment became effective` IS A DATE @desc If so, what day (YYYY-MM-DD; any date if not)?
      `the day I became an interested stockholder` IS A DATE @desc On what day did you become an interested stockholder (YYYY-MM-DD)?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Does our corporation's election to be governed by section 203 apply to me as an interested stockholder` IF
    `s 203(b) the corporation's election to be governed applies to the interested stockholder` `our original certificate elected to be governed` `an amendment to our certificate elected to be governed` (IF `the amendment became effective on a day` THEN JUST `the day the amendment became effective` ELSE NOTHING) `the day I became an interested stockholder`

§ `Section 203(c): what the section's terms mean`

@export Am I an affiliate of this person (s 203(c)(1))?
GIVEN `I control the other person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you control the other person, directly or indirectly through 1 or more intermediaries?
      `the other person controls me` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the other person in control of you, directly or indirectly through 1 or more intermediaries?
      `we are under common control` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you and the other person under common control, directly or indirectly through 1 or more intermediaries?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Am I an affiliate of this person` IF
    `s 203(c)(1) the person is an affiliate of the other person` `I control the other person` `the other person controls me` `we are under common control`

@export Is this entity my associate because I am its director, officer or partner or own 20% or more of a class of its voting stock (s 203(c)(2)(i))?
GIVEN `I am a director, officer or partner of the entity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a director, officer or partner of the corporation, partnership, unincorporated association or other entity?
      `the votes of a class of its voting stock that I own` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes of a class of the entity's voting stock do you own, directly or indirectly?
      `the votes of that class` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes does that class of voting stock carry in all?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is this entity my associate` IS
    `s 203(c)(2) the other party is an associate of the person` (`a corporation, partnership, unincorporated association or other entity under s 203(c)(2)(i)` OF `I am a director, officer or partner of the entity`, `the votes of a class of its voting stock that I own`, `the votes of that class`)

@export Is this trust or estate my associate because I have at least a 20% beneficial interest in it or serve as its trustee (s 203(c)(2)(ii))?
GIVEN `my beneficial interest, as a percentage` IS A NUMBER @desc What is your beneficial interest in the trust or other estate, as a percentage (0 to 100)?
      `I serve as its trustee or in a similar fiduciary capacity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you serve as trustee of it, or in a similar fiduciary capacity?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is this trust or estate my associate` IS
    `s 203(c)(2) the other party is an associate of the person` (`a trust or other estate under s 203(c)(2)(ii)` OF ((`my beneficial interest, as a percentage`) DIVIDED BY 100), `I serve as its trustee or in a similar fiduciary capacity`)

@export Is this relative or spouse my associate because they share my residence (s 203(c)(2)(iii))?
GIVEN `they are my relative or spouse, or a relative of my spouse` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the other party your relative or spouse, or a relative of your spouse?
      `they have the same residence as I do` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the other party have the same residence as you?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is this relative or spouse my associate` IS
    `s 203(c)(2) the other party is an associate of the person` (IF `they are my relative or spouse, or a relative of my spouse` THEN `a relative or spouse of the person, or a relative of that spouse, under s 203(c)(2)(iii)` OF `they have the same residence as I do` ELSE `anything else under s 203(c)(2)`)

@export Is this merger or consolidation a business combination with me as the interested stockholder (s 203(c)(3)(i))?
GIVEN `it is a merger or consolidation of the corporation or of a majority-owned subsidiary` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it a merger or consolidation of the corporation, or of a direct or indirect majority-owned subsidiary of the corporation?
      `it is with me` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it with the interested stockholder?
      `it is with another corporation, partnership, association or entity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it with any other corporation, partnership, unincorporated association or other entity?
      `it is caused by me` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it caused by the interested stockholder?
      `as a result subsection (a) does not apply to the surviving entity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As a result of it, is section 203(a) not applicable to the surviving entity?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is this merger or consolidation a business combination with me as the interested stockholder` IF
    `s 203(c)(3)(i) the merger or consolidation is a business combination` (`s 203(c)(3)(i) A merger or consolidation` OF `it is a merger or consolidation of the corporation or of a majority-owned subsidiary`, `it is with me`, `it is with another corporation, partnership, association or entity`, `it is caused by me`, `as a result subsection (a) does not apply to the surviving entity`)

@export Is this sale, lease or other disposition of assets a business combination with me as the interested stockholder (s 203(c)(3)(ii))?
GIVEN `it is a disposition of assets of the corporation or a majority-owned subsidiary` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it a sale, lease, exchange, mortgage, pledge, transfer or other disposition (in 1 transaction or a series of transactions), whether as part of a dissolution or otherwise, of assets of the corporation or of a direct or indirect majority-owned subsidiary?
      `it is to or with me` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it to or with the interested stockholder?
      `it is made proportionately as a stockholder` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it made proportionately as a stockholder of the corporation?
      `the market value of the assets` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the aggregate market value of the assets, in dollars?
      `the market value of all the corporation's assets, consolidated` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the aggregate market value of all the assets of the corporation determined on a consolidated basis, in dollars?
      `the market value of all the outstanding stock` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the aggregate market value of all the outstanding stock of the corporation, in dollars?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is this disposition of assets a business combination with me as the interested stockholder` IF
    `s 203(c)(3)(ii) the disposition of assets is a business combination` (`s 203(c)(3)(ii) A disposition of assets` OF `it is a disposition of assets of the corporation or a majority-owned subsidiary`, `it is to or with me`, `it is made proportionately as a stockholder`, `the market value of the assets`, `the market value of all the corporation's assets, consolidated`, `the market value of all the outstanding stock`)

@export Is this issuance or transfer of stock to me a business combination (s 203(c)(3)(iii))?
GIVEN `it issues or transfers stock to me` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the transaction result in the issuance or transfer, by the corporation or by a majority-owned subsidiary, of stock of the corporation or the subsidiary to the interested stockholder?
      `it is under securities outstanding before I became an interested stockholder` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it pursuant to the exercise, exchange or conversion of securities exercisable for, exchangeable for or convertible into stock which were outstanding before you became an interested stockholder?
      `it is under a section 251(g) merger` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it pursuant to a merger under section 251(g)?
      `it is a pro rata dividend or distribution` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it pursuant to a dividend or distribution (or the exercise, exchange or conversion of securities distributed) pro rata to all holders of a class or series after you became an interested stockholder?
      `it is an exchange offer on the same terms to all holders` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it pursuant to an exchange offer by the corporation to purchase stock made on the same terms to all holders of that stock?
      `it is any issuance or transfer of stock by the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it an issuance or transfer of stock by the corporation?
      `it increases my proportionate share` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it increase your proportionate share of the stock of any class or series of the corporation, or of its voting stock?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is this issuance or transfer of stock to me a business combination` IF
    `s 203(c)(3)(iii) the issuance or transfer of stock is a business combination` (`s 203(c)(3)(iii) An issuance or transfer of stock` OF `it issues or transfers stock to me`, `it is under securities outstanding before I became an interested stockholder`, `it is under a section 251(g) merger`, `it is a pro rata dividend or distribution`, `it is an exchange offer on the same terms to all holders`, `it is any issuance or transfer of stock by the corporation`, `it increases my proportionate share`)

@export Is this transaction that increases my proportionate share of the stock a business combination (s 203(c)(3)(iv))?
GIVEN `it has the effect of increasing my proportionate share` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the transaction, involving the corporation or a majority-owned subsidiary, have the effect (directly or indirectly) of increasing the proportionate share of the stock of any class or series (or securities convertible into it) that you own?
      `the increase is an immaterial fractional share adjustment` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the increase the result of immaterial changes due to fractional share adjustments?
      `the increase is from a purchase or redemption I did not cause` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the increase the result of any purchase or redemption of shares not caused, directly or indirectly, by you?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is this transaction that increases my proportionate share of the stock a business combination` IF
    `s 203(c)(3)(iv) the transaction increasing the interested stockholder's share is a business combination` (`s 203(c)(3)(iv) A transaction increasing the interested stockholder's share` OF `it has the effect of increasing my proportionate share`, `the increase is an immaterial fractional share adjustment`, `the increase is from a purchase or redemption I did not cause`)

@export Is my receipt of this loan, guarantee or other financial benefit a business combination (s 203(c)(3)(v))?
GIVEN `I receive a financial benefit through the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you receive the benefit, directly or indirectly, of loans, advances, guarantees, pledges or other financial benefits provided by or through the corporation or a majority-owned subsidiary?
      `I receive it proportionately as a stockholder` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you receive it proportionately as a stockholder of the corporation?
      `it is expressly permitted in paragraphs (c)(3)(i) to (iv)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it expressly permitted in paragraphs (c)(3)(i) to (iv) of section 203?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is my receipt of this financial benefit a business combination` IF
    `s 203(c)(3)(v) the receipt of a financial benefit is a business combination` (`s 203(c)(3)(v) A receipt of a financial benefit` OF `I receive a financial benefit through the corporation`, `I receive it proportionately as a stockholder`, `it is expressly permitted in paragraphs (c)(3)(i) to (iv)`)

@export Do I have control of this entity (s 203(c)(4))?
GIVEN `I have the power to direct the entity's management and policies` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you possess, directly or indirectly, the power to direct or cause the direction of the entity's management and policies, whether through the ownership of voting stock, by contract or otherwise?
      `the votes of its outstanding voting stock that I own` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes of the entity's outstanding voting stock do you own?
      `the votes of its outstanding voting stock` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes does the entity's outstanding voting stock carry in all?
      `the presumption of control is rebutted` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the presumption of control been rebutted by proof by a preponderance of the evidence?
      `I hold the stock in good faith as an agent, nominee or trustee for owners who do not control` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you hold the voting stock in good faith and not to circumvent section 203, as an agent, bank, broker, nominee, custodian or trustee for 1 or more owners who do not individually or as a group have control of the entity?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Do I have control of this entity` IS
    `s 203(c)(4) the person has control of the entity` (`s 203(c)(4) Facts about control of an entity` OF `I have the power to direct the entity's management and policies`, `the votes of its outstanding voting stock that I own`, `the votes of its outstanding voting stock`, `the presumption of control is rebutted`, `I hold the stock in good faith as an agent, nominee or trustee for owners who do not control`)

@export How many votes of the corporation's voting stock do I own (s 203(c)(9))?
GIVEN `votes I beneficially own` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes of the stock do you beneficially own, directly or indirectly (alone or with or through your affiliates or associates)?
      `votes I may acquire from outstanding stock` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes of outstanding stock do you have the right to acquire (now or after the passage of time), by agreement, conversion, exchange, warrants, options or otherwise, not counting stock tendered to your own offer?
      `votes I may acquire from unissued stock` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes of stock not yet issued do you have the right to acquire in that way?
      `votes tendered to my offer and not yet accepted` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes of stock have been tendered to a tender or exchange offer made by you or your affiliates or associates, and not yet accepted for purchase or exchange?
      `votes tendered to my offer and accepted` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes of stock tendered to such an offer have been accepted for purchase or exchange?
      `votes I may vote under an agreement` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes do you have the right to vote under an agreement, arrangement or understanding that is not a revocable proxy or consent?
      `votes I may vote only under a revocable proxy` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes do you have the right to vote solely under a revocable proxy or consent given in response to a solicitation?
      `the number of persons solicited` IS A NUMBER @desc To how many persons was that proxy or consent solicitation made?
      `votes under my agreement with another beneficial owner` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes are subject to an agreement, arrangement or understanding between you and another person that beneficially owns the stock, for the purpose of acquiring, holding, voting or disposing of it (other than voting under such a revocable proxy)?
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `How many votes of the corporation's voting stock do I own` IS
    `s 203(c)(9) the votes of the voting stock that the person owns` (LIST `a beneficially owned block`, `a block I may acquire from outstanding stock`, `a block I may acquire from unissued stock`, `a block tendered to my offer and not accepted`, `a block tendered to my offer and accepted`, `a block I may vote under an agreement`, `a block I may vote only under a revocable proxy`, `a block under my agreement with another beneficial owner`)
    WHERE
        `a beneficially owned block` MEANS `dg3 seat block` `votes I beneficially own` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE
        `a block I may acquire from outstanding stock` MEANS `dg3 seat block` `votes I may acquire from outstanding stock` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE
        `a block I may acquire from unissued stock` MEANS `dg3 seat block` `votes I may acquire from unissued stock` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE
        `a block tendered to my offer and not accepted` MEANS `dg3 seat block` `votes tendered to my offer and not yet accepted` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE
        `a block tendered to my offer and accepted` MEANS `dg3 seat block` `votes tendered to my offer and accepted` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE
        `a block I may vote under an agreement` MEANS `dg3 seat block` `votes I may vote under an agreement` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE
        `a block I may vote only under a revocable proxy` MEANS `dg3 seat block` `votes I may vote only under a revocable proxy` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE `the number of persons solicited` FALSE FALSE
        `a block under my agreement with another beneficial owner` MEANS `dg3 seat block` `votes under my agreement with another beneficial owner` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 TRUE FALSE

-- The person's holdings are put into blocks of voting stock, one block for each way of owning that section 203(c)(9) lists.
-- A helper of the seat layer (it decides nothing: it only builds the layer-1 record from the answers).
GIVEN votes IS A NUMBER
      outstanding IS A BOOLEAN
      beneficial IS A BOOLEAN
      right IS A BOOLEAN
      tendered IS A BOOLEAN
      accepted IS A BOOLEAN
      voteRight IS A BOOLEAN
      proxy IS A BOOLEAN
      solicited IS A NUMBER
      agreement IS A BOOLEAN
      revocableVoting IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 203(c)(9) A block of voting stock`
`dg3 seat block` votes outstanding beneficial right tendered accepted voteRight proxy solicited agreement revocableVoting MEANS
    `s 203(c)(9) A block of voting stock` WITH
        `the votes of the block` IS votes
        `the block is outstanding` IS outstanding
        `the person, individually or with or through its affiliates or associates, beneficially owns the block, directly or indirectly` IS beneficial
        `the person has the right to acquire the block` IS right
        `the block is tendered pursuant to a tender or exchange offer made by the person or any of its affiliates or associates` IS tendered
        `the tendered block has been accepted for purchase or exchange` IS accepted
        `the person has the right to vote the block pursuant to an agreement, arrangement or understanding` IS voteRight
        `that agreement, arrangement or understanding arises solely from a revocable proxy or consent given in response to a solicitation` IS proxy
        `the number of persons to whom that solicitation was made` IS solicited
        `the person has an agreement, arrangement or understanding for the purpose of acquiring, holding, voting or disposing of the block with another person that beneficially owns it` IS agreement
        `the voting under that agreement is pursuant to a revocable proxy or consent as described in item (B) of subparagraph (ii)` IS revocableVoting

@export Am I an interested stockholder of the corporation (s 203(c)(5))?
GIVEN `the votes of the corporation's voting stock outstanding` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes does the corporation's outstanding voting stock carry in all?
      `votes I beneficially own` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes of the stock do you beneficially own, directly or indirectly (alone or with or through your affiliates or associates)?
      `votes I may acquire from outstanding stock` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes of outstanding stock do you have the right to acquire (now or after the passage of time), by agreement, conversion, exchange, warrants, options or otherwise, not counting stock tendered to your own offer?
      `votes I may acquire from unissued stock` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes of stock not yet issued do you have the right to acquire in that way?
      `votes tendered to my offer and not yet accepted` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes of stock have been tendered to a tender or exchange offer made by you or your affiliates or associates, and not yet accepted for purchase or exchange?
      `votes tendered to my offer and accepted` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes of stock tendered to such an offer have been accepted for purchase or exchange?
      `votes I may vote under an agreement` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes do you have the right to vote under an agreement, arrangement or understanding that is not a revocable proxy or consent?
      `votes I may vote only under a revocable proxy` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes do you have the right to vote solely under a revocable proxy or consent given in response to a solicitation?
      `the number of persons solicited` IS A NUMBER @desc To how many persons was that proxy or consent solicitation made?
      `votes under my agreement with another beneficial owner` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes are subject to an agreement, arrangement or understanding between you and another person that beneficially owns the stock, for the purpose of acquiring, holding, voting or disposing of it (other than voting under such a revocable proxy)?
      `I am the corporation or a majority-owned subsidiary of it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you the corporation, or a direct or indirect majority-owned subsidiary of the corporation?
      `I am an affiliate or associate of the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you an affiliate or associate of the corporation?
      `I owned 15% or more of its voting stock within the last 3 years` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were you the owner of 15% or more of the corporation's outstanding voting stock at any time within the 3-year period immediately before the date it is sought to be determined whether you are an interested stockholder?
      `I am an affiliate or associate of an interested stockholder` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you an affiliate or associate of a person who is an interested stockholder because of the 15% test or the affiliate-or-associate test?
      `I owned shares in excess of 15% on 23 December 1987` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you own shares in excess of 15% of the voting stock as of 23 December 1987?
      `I acquired shares under a tender offer` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you acquire the shares pursuant to a tender offer?
      `the day that tender offer commenced` IS A DATE @desc If so, on what day did it commence (YYYY-MM-DD; any date if not)?
      `I acquired shares under an exchange offer` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you acquire the shares pursuant to an exchange offer?
      `the day that exchange offer was announced` IS A DATE @desc If so, on what day was it announced (YYYY-MM-DD; any date if not)?
      `the day that exchange offer commenced` IS A DATE @desc If so, on what day did it commence (YYYY-MM-DD; any date if not)?
      `I continued to own more than 15%, or would have but for the corporation's action` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you continue to own shares in excess of 15%, or would you have but for action by the corporation?
      `I am an affiliate or associate of the corporation and so continued within the 3 years` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you an affiliate or associate of the corporation who so continued (or would have but for the corporation's action) to be the owner of 15% or more at any time within the 3-year period?
      `I acquired the shares from such a person by gift, inheritance or for no consideration` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you acquire the shares from a person described by the grandfathering rule above by gift, inheritance or in a transaction in which no consideration was exchanged?
      `my holding over 15% results solely from the corporation's action` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is your ownership of shares in excess of 15% the result of action taken solely by the corporation?
      `I later acquired more shares other than by further corporate action not caused by me` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Since then, have you acquired additional shares of voting stock, other than as a result of further corporate action not caused, directly or indirectly, by you?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Am I an interested stockholder of the corporation` IS
    `s 203(c)(5) the person is an interested stockholder` `me and the corporation`
    WHERE
        `me and the corporation` MEANS `s 203(c)(5) Facts about a person and the corporation` WITH
            `the person is the corporation or a direct or indirect majority-owned subsidiary of the corporation` IS `I am the corporation or a majority-owned subsidiary of it`
            `the votes of the voting stock of the corporation outstanding` IS `the votes of the corporation's voting stock outstanding`
            `the blocks of voting stock the person may be the owner of` IS
                LIST (`dg3 seat block` `votes I beneficially own` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE)
                   , (`dg3 seat block` `votes I may acquire from outstanding stock` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE)
                   , (`dg3 seat block` `votes I may acquire from unissued stock` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE)
                   , (`dg3 seat block` `votes tendered to my offer and not yet accepted` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE)
                   , (`dg3 seat block` `votes tendered to my offer and accepted` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE)
                   , (`dg3 seat block` `votes I may vote under an agreement` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE)
                   , (`dg3 seat block` `votes I may vote only under a revocable proxy` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE `the number of persons solicited` FALSE FALSE)
                   , (`dg3 seat block` `votes under my agreement with another beneficial owner` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 TRUE FALSE)
            `the person is an affiliate or associate of the corporation` IS `I am an affiliate or associate of the corporation`
            `the person was the owner of 15% or more of the outstanding voting stock of the corporation at any time within the 3-year period immediately prior to the date it is sought to be determined whether the person is an interested stockholder` IS `I owned 15% or more of its voting stock within the last 3 years`
            `the person is an affiliate or associate of a person who is an interested stockholder under item (i) or (ii)` IS `I am an affiliate or associate of an interested stockholder`
            `the exclusions` IS `s 203(c)(5) The facts that take a person out of the term` WITH
                `the person owned shares in excess of the 15% limitation as of December 23, 1987` IS `I owned shares in excess of 15% on 23 December 1987`
                `the day the tender offer was commenced, if the person acquired the shares pursuant to one` IS IF `I acquired shares under a tender offer` THEN JUST `the day that tender offer commenced` ELSE NOTHING
                `the day the exchange offer was announced, if the person acquired the shares pursuant to one` IS IF `I acquired shares under an exchange offer` THEN JUST `the day that exchange offer was announced` ELSE NOTHING
                `the day the exchange offer was commenced, if the person acquired the shares pursuant to one` IS IF `I acquired shares under an exchange offer` THEN JUST `the day that exchange offer commenced` ELSE NOTHING
                `the person continued to own shares in excess of the 15% limitation, or would have but for action by the corporation` IS `I continued to own more than 15%, or would have but for the corporation's action`
                `the person is an affiliate or associate of the corporation and so continued to be the owner of 15% or more of the outstanding voting stock at any time within the 3-year period` IS `I am an affiliate or associate of the corporation and so continued within the 3 years`
                `the person acquired the shares from a person described in item (A) by gift, inheritance or in a transaction in which no consideration was exchanged` IS `I acquired the shares from such a person by gift, inheritance or for no consideration`
                `the person's ownership of shares in excess of the 15% limitation is the result of action taken solely by the corporation` IS `my holding over 15% results solely from the corporation's action`
                `thereafter the person acquired additional shares of voting stock of the corporation, other than as a result of further corporate action not caused, directly or indirectly, by the person` IS `I later acquired more shares other than by further corporate action not caused by me`

@export Is the kind of entity I deal with a "person" for section 203 (s 203(c)(6))?
GIVEN `the kind of entity` IS A `Kind of entity` @desc What kind of entity is it? One of the kinds of entity in the Law's list (a natural person; a corporation; a general partnership; a limited partnership; a limited liability partnership; a limited liability limited partnership; a limited liability company; a statutory trust; a business trust or association; a real estate investment trust; a common-law trust; a joint-stock association; any other unincorporated business or association).
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is the kind of entity a person for section 203` IF
    `s 203(c)(6) the kind of entity is a person` `the kind of entity`

@export Is this interest "stock" for section 203 (s 203(c)(7))?
GIVEN `the issuer` IS A `Kind of entity` @desc What kind of entity issued the interest? One of the Law's kinds of entity (for a corporation, use: a corporation; for a partnership, company or trust, the matching kind).
      `the interest is capital stock` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the interest capital stock?
      `the interest is an equity interest` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the interest an equity interest?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is this interest stock for section 203` IS
    `s 203(c)(7) the interest is stock` `the issuer` `the interest is capital stock` `the interest is an equity interest`

@export Is this interest "voting stock" for section 203 (s 203(c)(8))?
GIVEN `the issuer` IS A `Kind of entity` @desc What kind of entity issued the interest? One of the Law's kinds of entity.
      `the stock is entitled to vote generally in the election of directors` IS A BOOLEAN @desc (Corporation) Is the stock of a class or series entitled to vote generally in the election of directors?
      `the equity interest is entitled to vote generally in the election of the governing body` IS A BOOLEAN @desc (Other entity) Is the equity interest entitled to vote generally in the election of the governing body of the entity?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is this interest voting stock for section 203` IS
    `s 203(c)(8) the interest is voting stock` `the issuer` `the stock is entitled to vote generally in the election of directors` `the equity interest is entitled to vote generally in the election of the governing body`

@export What percentage of the corporation's voting stock do these votes represent (s 203(c)(8))?
GIVEN `the votes` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes?
      `the votes of the voting stock in all` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes does the voting stock carry in all?
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `What percentage of the voting stock do these votes represent` IS
    -- The layer-1 rule gives a proportion (0.15 for 15 of 100); this question answers on the 0 to 100 scale it asks its other percentages on, so the proportion is multiplied by 100.
    CONSIDER `s 203(c)(8) the percentage of the voting stock that the votes represent` `the votes` `the votes of the voting stock in all`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST proportion THEN JUST (proportion TIMES 100)

§ `Section 203(d) and (e): votes in the certificate or bylaws; the court`

@export Can our certificate or bylaws require a greater vote than section 203 specifies (s 203(d))?
GIVEN `the proportion our provision requires, as a percentage` IS A NUMBER @desc What proportion of the outstanding stock (or of the votes) does our provision require for the vote, as a percentage (0 to 100)?
      `our provision requires more than that proportion` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does our provision require more than that proportion (as against at least that proportion)?
      `the proportion the section specifies, as a percentage` IS A NUMBER @desc What proportion does section 203 specify for the same vote (for example 66.67 for the vote in section 203(a)(3)), as a percentage?
      `the section requires more than that proportion` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does section 203 require more than that proportion (as against at least that proportion)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Does our provision require a greater vote than section 203 specifies` IS
    `s 203(d) the provision requires a greater vote than this section specifies` (`Vote requirement` WITH `counted against` IS `the outstanding stock entitled to vote`, proportion IS (`the proportion our provision requires, as a percentage`) DIVIDED BY 100, `must be exceeded` IS `our provision requires more than that proportion`) (`Vote requirement` WITH `counted against` IS `the outstanding stock entitled to vote`, proportion IS (`the proportion the section specifies, as a percentage`) DIVIDED BY 100, `must be exceeded` IS `the section requires more than that proportion`)

@export Which court may hear and determine a matter with respect to section 203 (s 203(e))?
GIVEN `the court` IS AN Actor @desc Which court? One of: the Court of Chancery; another party named in the provision (any other court).
      `the matter is a matter with respect to section 203` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the matter a matter with respect to section 203?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Does the court have jurisdiction to hear and determine the matter` IS
    `s 203(e) the court has jurisdiction to hear and determine the matter` `the court` `the matter is a matter with respect to section 203`


§ `Section 203 as a whole: may the corporation engage in the business combination?`

-- The whole of section 203 for one business combination with one interested stockholder: subsection (a)'s 3-year bar and its three exceptions, and every exemption in subsection (b).
-- The form asks only the inputs that still matter for the answer. The answer is "barred" (JUST TRUE), "not barred" (JUST FALSE), or not covered (NOTHING).
@export Is our corporation barred from engaging in this business combination with the interested stockholder (s 203)?
GIVEN `the day the stockholder became an interested stockholder` IS A DATE @desc On what day did the stockholder become an interested stockholder (YYYY-MM-DD)?
      `the day of the business combination` IS A DATE @desc On what day is the business combination (YYYY-MM-DD)?
      `the board approved the business combination before that time` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Before that time, did the corporation's board of directors approve the business combination?
      `the board approved the transaction that made the stockholder an interested stockholder` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Before that time, did the board approve the transaction which resulted in the stockholder becoming an interested stockholder?
      `the votes the interested stockholder owned upon consummation of the transaction` IS A NUMBER @desc Upon consummation of the transaction which made the stockholder an interested stockholder, how many votes of the corporation's voting stock did the stockholder own?
      `the votes outstanding when the transaction commenced` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes did the corporation's voting stock carry in all, outstanding at the time the transaction commenced?
      `the votes of stock owned by directors who are also officers` IS A NUMBER @desc How many of those votes were stock owned by persons who are directors and also officers?
      `of those, the votes the interested stockholder owns` IS A NUMBER @desc Of those, how many votes does the interested stockholder itself own?
      `the votes of stock in employee plans without a confidential tender decision` IS A NUMBER @desc How many of those votes were stock held in employee stock plans in which participants do not have the right to determine confidentially whether shares held subject to the plan will be tendered?
      `of those plan votes, the votes the interested stockholder owns` IS A NUMBER @desc Of those, how many votes does the interested stockholder itself own?
      `the board approved the business combination at or after that time` IS A BOOLEAN @desc At or subsequent to that time, did the board of directors approve the business combination?
      `it was authorized at an annual or special meeting` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was it authorized at an annual or special meeting of stockholders?
      `it was authorized by written consent` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was it authorized by written consent?
      `the votes in favor` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes were cast in favor, of the outstanding voting stock which is not owned by the interested stockholder?
      `the votes of the outstanding voting stock not owned by the interested stockholder` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes does the outstanding voting stock which the interested stockholder does not own carry in all?
      `our original certificate contains such a provision` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the corporation's original certificate of incorporation contain a provision expressly electing not to be governed by section 203?
      `our board adopted such an amendment` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the board of directors adopt an amendment to the bylaws expressly electing not to be governed by section 203?
      `the day our board adopted it` IS A DATE @desc If so, on what day (YYYY-MM-DD; any date if not)?
      `our stockholders adopted an amendment electing out` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the stockholders adopt an amendment to the certificate of incorporation or bylaws expressly electing not to be governed by section 203?
      `the instrument the stockholders amended` IS A `s 203(b)(3) Which instrument the stockholders amended` @desc If so, which instrument? One of: the certificate of incorporation under s 203(b)(3); the bylaws under s 203(b)(3).
      `the votes in favor of the amendment` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes were cast in favor of the amendment?
      `the outstanding stock entitled to vote, in votes` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes does the outstanding stock entitled to vote carry in all?
      `another law requires a greater vote` IS A BOOLEAN @desc In addition to the majority, does any other law require a greater vote?
      `the percentage another law requires` IS A NUMBER @desc If so, what percentage of the outstanding stock entitled to vote (0 to 100; 0 if none)?
      `we have never had a listed or widely held class of voting stock` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the corporation never had a class of voting stock that is listed on a national securities exchange or held of record by more than 2,000 stockholders?
      `we have not elected to be governed by section 203` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the corporation not elected, by a provision in its original certificate or any amendment, to be governed by section 203?
      `the day of the amendment` IS A DATE @desc For a certificate amendment, the day it takes effect under section 103; for a bylaw amendment, the day it was adopted (YYYY-MM-DD).
      `a class of our voting stock is listed on a national securities exchange` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is a class of the corporation's voting stock listed on a national securities exchange?
      `that listing results from an interested stockholder's action or a transaction in which a person becomes one` IS A BOOLEAN @desc If so, does the listing result from action taken, directly or indirectly, by an interested stockholder or from a transaction in which a person becomes an interested stockholder?
      `the most holders of record of any class of our voting stock` IS A NUMBER @desc How many stockholders of record hold the class of voting stock that has the most holders?
      `that number results from an interested stockholder's action or a transaction in which a person becomes one` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does that number result from action taken, directly or indirectly, by an interested stockholder or from a transaction in which a person becomes an interested stockholder?
      `the stockholder became an interested stockholder inadvertently` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the stockholder become an interested stockholder inadvertently?
      `the stockholder divested enough shares as soon as practicable` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the stockholder, as soon as practicable, divest itself of ownership of sufficient shares so that it ceased to be an interested stockholder?
      `the stockholder would not have been one in the previous 3 years but for the inadvertent acquisition` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would the stockholder not, at any time within the 3-year period immediately before the business combination, have been an interested stockholder but for the inadvertent acquisition of ownership?
      `the kind of transaction proposed` IS A `dg3 seat The kind of transaction proposed` @desc Which kind of transaction is proposed? One of: a merger or consolidation of the corporation, as proposed; a sale or other disposition of assets, as proposed; a tender or exchange offer, as proposed; another transaction, as proposed.
      `no stockholder vote is required for the merger under section 251(f)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc (Merger) Is no vote of the corporation's stockholders required, pursuant to section 251(f)?
      `the disposition is to a wholly-owned subsidiary or to the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc (Assets) Is the disposition to a direct or indirect wholly-owned subsidiary or to the corporation?
      `the market value of the assets` IS A NUMBER @desc (Assets) What is the aggregate market value of the assets disposed of, in dollars?
      `the market value of all the corporation's assets, consolidated` IS A NUMBER @desc (Assets) What is the aggregate market value of all the assets of the corporation determined on a consolidated basis, in dollars?
      `the market value of all the outstanding stock` IS A NUMBER @desc (Assets) What is the aggregate market value of all the outstanding stock of the corporation, in dollars?
      `the votes of voting stock the offer is for` IS A NUMBER @desc (Offer) How many votes of the corporation's outstanding voting stock is the offer for?
      `the votes of the outstanding voting stock` IS A NUMBER @desc (Offer) How many votes does the corporation's outstanding voting stock carry in all?
      `the day the business combination is proposed` IS A DATE @desc On what day is the business combination proposed (YYYY-MM-DD)?
      `the transaction was publicly announced` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the proposed transaction been publicly announced?
      `the day it was announced` IS A DATE @desc If so, on what day (YYYY-MM-DD; any date if not)?
      `notice of the transaction was given` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the notice required by section 203 of the proposed transaction been given?
      `the day the notice was given` IS A DATE @desc If so, on what day (YYYY-MM-DD; any date if not)?
      `the transaction was consummated or abandoned` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the proposed transaction been consummated or abandoned?
      `the day it was consummated or abandoned` IS A DATE @desc If so, on what day (YYYY-MM-DD; any date if not)?
      `the person was not an interested stockholder in the previous 3 years` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the person with or by whom the transaction is proposed not an interested stockholder during the previous 3 years?
      `the person became one with the board's approval` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did that person become an interested stockholder with the approval of the corporation's board of directors?
      `the person became one during the period described in paragraph (b)(7)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did that person become an interested stockholder during the period described in section 203(b)(7)?
      `the continuing directors in office` IS A NUMBER @desc How many members of the board then in office were directors before any person became an interested stockholder in the previous 3 years, or were recommended for election or elected to succeed such directors by a majority of them?
      `how many of them approved or did not oppose` IS A NUMBER @desc How many of those members approved or did not oppose the proposed transaction?
      `the restrictions did not apply when the stockholder became one, by reason of paragraph (b)(1) to (4)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc When the stockholder became an interested stockholder, did the restrictions in section 203 not apply by reason of any of paragraphs (b)(1) through (4)?
      `our certificate then contained a provision electing to be governed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc At that time, did the certificate of incorporation contain a provision authorized by the last sentence of section 203(b) (electing to be governed by section 203)?
      `our original certificate elected to be governed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the corporation elect, by a provision of its original certificate of incorporation, to be governed by section 203?
      `an amendment to our certificate elected to be governed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the corporation elect, by an amendment to its certificate of incorporation, to be governed by section 203?
      `the amendment became effective on a day` IS A BOOLEAN @desc If by amendment: do you know the day it became effective under section 103?
      `the day the amendment became effective` IS A DATE @desc If so, what day (YYYY-MM-DD; any date if not)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is our corporation barred from engaging in this business combination with the interested stockholder` IS
    `s 203 the corporation may not engage in the business combination` (`s 203(b) the restrictions contained in this section do not apply` `paragraph 1` `paragraph 2` `paragraph 3` `paragraph 4` `the election applies` `paragraph 5` `paragraph 6` `paragraph 7`) (`s 203(a) the corporation is barred from engaging in the business combination` `our facts`)
    WHERE
        `paragraph 1` MEANS `s 203(b)(1) the restrictions do not apply because the original certificate elects out` `our original certificate contains such a provision`
        `paragraph 2` MEANS `s 203(b)(2) the restrictions do not apply because the board adopted a bylaw election in 1988` (IF `our board adopted such an amendment` THEN JUST `the day our board adopted it` ELSE NOTHING)
        `paragraph 3` MEANS
                `our stockholders adopted an amendment electing out`
            AND `s 203(b)(3) the restrictions do not apply because of the stockholders' election` `our election` `the day of the business combination` `the day the stockholder became an interested stockholder`
        `paragraph 4` MEANS `s 203(b)(4) the restrictions do not apply because the corporation has no listed or widely held class of voting stock` `our classes`
        `paragraph 5` MEANS `s 203(b)(5) the restrictions do not apply because the stockholder became an interested stockholder inadvertently` `the stockholder became an interested stockholder inadvertently` `the stockholder divested enough shares as soon as practicable` `the stockholder would not have been one in the previous 3 years but for the inadvertent acquisition`
        `paragraph 6` MEANS `s 203(b)(6) the restrictions do not apply because of the proposal of the business combination` `the transaction` `the proposal`
        `paragraph 7` MEANS `s 203(b)(7) the restrictions do not apply because the stockholder became an interested stockholder when they did not apply` `the restrictions did not apply when the stockholder became one, by reason of paragraph (b)(1) to (4)` `our certificate then contained a provision electing to be governed`
        `the election applies` MEANS `s 203(b) the corporation's election to be governed applies to the interested stockholder` `our original certificate elected to be governed` `an amendment to our certificate elected to be governed` (IF `the amendment became effective on a day` THEN JUST `the day the amendment became effective` ELSE NOTHING) `the day the stockholder became an interested stockholder`
        `our facts` MEANS `s 203(a) Facts about a business combination with an interested stockholder` WITH
            `the day the stockholder became an interested stockholder` IS `the day the stockholder became an interested stockholder`
            `the day of the business combination` IS `the day of the business combination`
            `prior to such time the board of directors approved the business combination` IS `the board approved the business combination before that time`
            `prior to such time the board of directors approved the transaction which resulted in the stockholder becoming an interested stockholder` IS `the board approved the transaction that made the stockholder an interested stockholder`
            `the votes of the voting stock that the interested stockholder owned upon consummation of the transaction` IS `the votes the interested stockholder owned upon consummation of the transaction`
            `the votes of the voting stock of the corporation outstanding at the time the transaction commenced` IS `the votes outstanding when the transaction commenced`
            `the votes of the outstanding stock owned by persons who are directors and also officers` IS `the votes of stock owned by directors who are also officers`
            `of those votes, the votes owned by the interested stockholder (directors and officers)` IS `of those, the votes the interested stockholder owns`
            `the votes of the outstanding stock owned by employee stock plans in which employee participants do not have the right to determine confidentially whether shares held subject to the plan will be tendered in a tender or exchange offer` IS `the votes of stock in employee plans without a confidential tender decision`
            `of those votes, the votes owned by the interested stockholder (employee stock plans)` IS `of those plan votes, the votes the interested stockholder owns`
            `at or subsequent to such time the business combination is approved by the board of directors` IS `the board approved the business combination at or after that time`
            `the business combination is authorized at an annual or special meeting of stockholders` IS `it was authorized at an annual or special meeting`
            `the business combination is authorized by written consent` IS `it was authorized by written consent`
            `the votes in favor of the business combination (the affirmative vote) of the outstanding voting stock which is not owned by the interested stockholder` IS `the votes in favor`
            `the votes of the outstanding voting stock which is not owned by the interested stockholder` IS `the votes of the outstanding voting stock not owned by the interested stockholder`
        `our election` MEANS `s 203(b)(3) Facts about an election by the stockholders` WITH
            `the instrument amended` IS `the instrument the stockholders amended`
            `the votes in favor of the amendment` IS `the votes in favor of the amendment`
            `the outstanding stock entitled to vote thereon, in votes` IS `the outstanding stock entitled to vote, in votes`
            `the greater vote required by any other law, if any` IS
                IF `another law requires a greater vote`
                THEN JUST (`at least` ((`the percentage another law requires`) DIVIDED BY 100) `of` `the outstanding stock entitled to vote`)
                ELSE NOTHING
            `the corporation has never had a class of voting stock that falls within either of the 2 categories set out in paragraph (b)(4)` IS `we have never had a listed or widely held class of voting stock`
            `the corporation has not elected by a provision in its original certificate of incorporation or any amendment to be governed by section 203` IS `we have not elected to be governed by section 203`
            `the day the amendment takes effect under section 103 (certificate) or the day it was adopted (bylaws)` IS `the day of the amendment`
        `our classes` MEANS `s 203(b)(4) Facts about the classes of voting stock` WITH
            `a class of voting stock is listed on a national securities exchange` IS `a class of our voting stock is listed on a national securities exchange`
            `that listing results from action taken, directly or indirectly, by an interested stockholder or from a transaction in which a person becomes an interested stockholder` IS `that listing results from an interested stockholder's action or a transaction in which a person becomes one`
            `the number of stockholders of record of the class of voting stock with the most holders` IS `the most holders of record of any class of our voting stock`
            `that number results from action taken, directly or indirectly, by an interested stockholder or from a transaction in which a person becomes an interested stockholder` IS `that number results from an interested stockholder's action or a transaction in which a person becomes one`
        `the transaction` MEANS
            CONSIDER `the kind of transaction proposed`
            WHEN `a merger or consolidation of the corporation, as proposed` THEN `a merger or consolidation of the corporation under s 203(b)(6)(x)` OF `no stockholder vote is required for the merger under section 251(f)`
            WHEN `a sale or other disposition of assets, as proposed` THEN `a disposition of assets under s 203(b)(6)(y)` OF TRUE, `the disposition is to a wholly-owned subsidiary or to the corporation`, `the market value of the assets`, `the market value of all the corporation's assets, consolidated`, `the market value of all the outstanding stock`
            WHEN `a tender or exchange offer, as proposed` THEN `a tender or exchange offer under s 203(b)(6)(z)` OF `the votes of voting stock the offer is for`, `the votes of the outstanding voting stock`
            WHEN `another transaction, as proposed` THEN `another transaction under s 203(b)(6)`
        `the proposal` MEANS `s 203(b)(6) Facts about the proposal and the person` WITH
            `the day the business combination is proposed` IS `the day the business combination is proposed`
            `the day of the public announcement of the proposed transaction, if any` IS IF `the transaction was publicly announced` THEN JUST `the day it was announced` ELSE NOTHING
            `the day of the notice required hereunder of the proposed transaction, if any` IS IF `notice of the transaction was given` THEN JUST `the day the notice was given` ELSE NOTHING
            `the day the proposed transaction is consummated or abandoned, if it has been` IS IF `the transaction was consummated or abandoned` THEN JUST `the day it was consummated or abandoned` ELSE NOTHING
            `the person was not an interested stockholder during the previous 3 years` IS `the person was not an interested stockholder in the previous 3 years`
            `the person became an interested stockholder with the approval of the corporation's board of directors` IS `the person became one with the board's approval`
            `the person became an interested stockholder during the period described in paragraph (b)(7)` IS `the person became one during the period described in paragraph (b)(7)`
            `the number of members of the board then in office who were directors prior to any person becoming an interested stockholder during the previous 3 years or were recommended for election or elected to succeed such directors by a majority of such directors` IS `the continuing directors in office`
            `the number of those members who approved or did not oppose the proposed transaction` IS `how many of them approved or did not oppose`
